
# game/a3s2.rpy:4
translate spanish a3s2_ec1e11ca:

    # "I plunge into the water with a splash, the cold taking my breath away in an instant."
    "Me hundo en el agua con un chapoteo y el frío me corta la respiración al instante."

# game/a3s2.rpy:5
translate spanish a3s2_7db50ab9:

    # "Immediately, I realize the mistake of jumping into the lake with a heavy robe."
    "Enseguida comprendo el error de haber saltado al lago con una túnica pesada."

# game/a3s2.rpy:6
translate spanish a3s2_d0e2e678:

    # "I'm able to kick out of the loose fitting garment within a few seconds though, and I start swimming around the edge of the balcony, toward the shore."
    "Pero consigo librarme de la prenda holgada en unos segundos y empiezo a nadar alrededor del borde del balcón, hacia la orilla."

# game/a3s2.rpy:7
translate spanish a3s2_0a6985ec:

    # "It's not that far, but I start to worry as I feel my arms and legs burn from the strain, and even though the beach is right in front of me, it seems to take longer than it should for my feet to touch ground."
    "No está muy lejos, pero empiezo a preocuparme al sentir arder los brazos y las piernas por el esfuerzo; aunque la playa está justo delante, mis pies parecen tardar más de lo debido en tocar el fondo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:8
translate spanish a3s2_e2701f7b:

    # "Just as I feel my limbs start to give out, I feel the sandy bottom of the lake against my toes."
    "Justo cuando siento que las extremidades empiezan a fallarme, noto el fondo arenoso del lago bajo los dedos de los pies."

# game/a3s2.rpy:9
translate spanish a3s2_7aaf8e69:

    # "I gasp with relief, struggling through the deeper end of the shallows before stumbling to my hands and knees, forcing myself to move forward until I reach the beach."
    "Jadeo aliviado y avanzo con esfuerzo por la parte más profunda de la orilla antes de caer de manos y rodillas, obligándome a seguir hasta llegar a la playa."

# game/a3s2.rpy:12
translate spanish a3s2_5c5cc45b:

    # "Even now, in this moment of desperation, I have to lay out in the sand for a moment, gasping for breath as I feel my numbed limbs come slowly back to life."
    "Incluso ahora, en este momento desesperado, debo tumbarme un instante en la arena, jadeando mientras mis extremidades entumecidas vuelven lentamente a la vida."

# game/a3s2.rpy:13
translate spanish a3s2_ce2ac205:

    # "I suppose all the anxiety and no food all day have left me feeling weak."
    "Supongo que la ansiedad y no haber comido en todo el día me han debilitado."

# game/a3s2.rpy:14
translate spanish a3s2_73154997:

    # "I finally realize how exposed I am out here, how easy it would be for someone to see me from the gardens, or even from the windows of the palace."
    "Finalmente comprendo lo expuesto que estoy aquí fuera, lo fácil que sería verme desde los jardines o incluso desde las ventanas del palacio."

# game/a3s2.rpy:15
translate spanish a3s2_b33d1be5:

    # "With a grunt, I force myself to roll over and start crawling for the treeline in the garden so that I can at least have some cover."
    "Con un gruñido, me obligo a darme la vuelta y empiezo a gatear hacia los árboles del jardín para tener al menos algo de cobertura."

# game/a3s2.rpy:17
translate spanish a3s2_49ab3d1d:

    # "As I crouch there in just my underwear, still trying to catch my breath, I realize how quiet it is out here."
    "Agachado allí solo en ropa interior, todavía intentando recuperar el aliento, noto lo silencioso que está todo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:18
translate spanish a3s2_1019231d:

    # "Again, it's a striking contrast to how violently things had changed just hours ago."
    "Es otro contraste sorprendente con la violencia de los cambios ocurridos hace unas horas."

# game/a3s2.rpy:19
translate spanish a3s2_9e8ca1ac:

    # "Finally, after a deep breath, I start pushing my way through the gardens, walking through the foliage rather than using the paths."
    "Por fin, tras respirar hondo, empiezo a abrirme paso por los jardines, atravesando la vegetación en lugar de usar los senderos."

# game/a3s2.rpy:20
translate spanish a3s2_977559af:

    # "I doubt anyone's taking a garden stroll considering what's happened, but the one thing I've learned is that no one's predictable here."
    "Dudo que nadie esté paseando después de lo ocurrido, pero he aprendido que aquí nadie es predecible."

# game/a3s2.rpy:21
translate spanish a3s2_280a14ce:

    # "So I try to keep hidden, using the large, exotic-looking plants as cover before leaping across paths and ducking into the plant-life again."
    "Así que intento ocultarme tras las grandes plantas exóticas antes de cruzar los caminos de un salto y volver a esconderme en la vegetación."

# game/a3s2.rpy:22
translate spanish a3s2_6afdb7db:

    # "As I get closer to the palace, I try to think about how I'm going to do this."
    "Al acercarme al palacio, intento pensar cómo lo haré."

# game/a3s2.rpy:23
translate spanish a3s2_7b9bd3c2:

    # "With any luck, no one's actually in the palace."
    "Con suerte, no habrá nadie dentro."

# game/a3s2.rpy:24
translate spanish a3s2_a337a35e:

    # "It would make sense after what happened."
    "Sería lógico después de lo ocurrido."

# game/a3s2.rpy:25
translate spanish a3s2_6cd60f06:

    # "If anyone IS in the palace, I just have to hope they aren't Cato."
    "Si HAY alguien en el palacio, solo puedo esperar que no sea Cato."

# game/a3s2.rpy:26
translate spanish a3s2_2c8d735c:

    # "There's also the problem of actually getting Amicus out of the dungeons."
    "También está el problema de sacar a Amicus de los calabozos."

# game/a3s2.rpy:27
translate spanish a3s2_9bc2428e:

    # "While I might be blind to Com, Amicus definitely isn't."
    "Aunque Com no pueda verme, a Amicus sí que puede."

# game/a3s2.rpy:28
translate spanish a3s2_ddc56ceb:

    # "I need to get to Neferu."
    "Necesito llegar hasta Neferu."

# game/a3s2.rpy:29
translate spanish a3s2_b687560e:

    # "He would definitely know about what's happened by now."
    "A estas alturas seguro que sabe lo ocurrido."

# game/a3s2.rpy:30
translate spanish a3s2_e2d118a8:

    # "Maybe we could come up with a plan if he doesn't have one already."
    "Quizá podamos elaborar un plan, si él no tiene ya uno."

# game/a3s2.rpy:31
translate spanish a3s2_69e45d01:

    # "He always seems to know what to do...well, usually."
    "Siempre parece saber qué hacer...bueno, normalmente."

# game/a3s2.rpy:32
translate spanish a3s2_12c144dc:

    # "I just have to hope that something hasn't happened to him."
    "Solo puedo esperar que no le haya pasado nada."

# game/a3s2.rpy:33
translate spanish a3s2_b96d8445:

    # "So, as I come up to the palace entrance, I look around, the quiet starting to become unnerving."
    "Así que, al acercarme a la entrada del palacio, miro alrededor; el silencio empieza a inquietarme."

# game/a3s2.rpy:34
translate spanish a3s2_16cb0a1a:

    # "I don't see anyone so, swallowing hard, I jog through the entrance of the palace."
    "No veo a nadie, así que trago saliva con dificultad y cruzo la entrada al trote."

# game/a3s2.rpy:36
translate spanish a3s2_58148b78:

    # "The cool air of the hallways hits my damp skin and makes me shiver, both from the cold and the tension."
    "El aire fresco de los pasillos golpea mi piel húmeda y me hace temblar, tanto por el frío como por la tensión."

# game/a3s2.rpy:37
translate spanish a3s2_4b9c0463:

    # "I'm sure to keep close to the walls, always looking ahead to a doorway or pillar that I can duck behind in case I see someone."
    "Me mantengo pegado a las paredes, buscando siempre una puerta o columna tras la que esconderme si veo a alguien."

# game/a3s2.rpy:38
translate spanish a3s2_b4b0bf79:

    # "Luckily, that doesn't happen, and I'm more and more convinced that no one is actually here."
    "Por suerte no ocurre, y cada vez estoy más convencido de que no hay nadie."

# game/a3s2.rpy:39
translate spanish a3s2_ed263fcd:

    # "Before I know it, I'm coming up on the hall that holds Neferu's room."
    "Antes de darme cuenta, llego al pasillo donde está la habitación de Neferu."

# game/a3s2.rpy:40
translate spanish a3s2_73f80a7f:

    # "My breathing quickens as I get closer to the door, knowing that I'll feel a lot better if I can just have some guidance."
    "Mi respiración se acelera al acercarme a la puerta; sé que me sentiré mucho mejor si consigo alguna orientación."

# game/a3s2.rpy:41
translate spanish a3s2_8c1dc149:

    # "I've been here for a while and I've gotten used to the way of things, but I'm completely out of my element now."
    "Llevo aquí un tiempo y me he acostumbrado a cómo funcionan las cosas, pero ahora estoy completamente fuera de mi elemento."

# game/a3s2.rpy:42
translate spanish a3s2_29690d26:

    # "I make it to the door and reach out, pressing the panel to slide it open."
    "Llego a la puerta y presiono el panel para abrirla."

# game/a3s2.rpy:45
translate spanish a3s2_15593824:

    # "The room is empty."
    "La habitación está vacía."

# game/a3s2.rpy:46
translate spanish a3s2_e126149b:

    # "I stare for a moment, as if doing that will make the jackal magically appear back in his bed where I last saw him."
    "Me quedo mirando un momento, como si eso hiciera aparecer mágicamente al chacal en la cama donde lo vi por última vez."

# game/a3s2.rpy:47
translate spanish a3s2_9f06f521:

    # "Then I see something on the floor:"
    "Después veo algo en el suelo:"

# game/a3s2.rpy:48
translate spanish a3s2_25eb6d6e:

    # "Green shards of shattered glass; wine bottles knocked from the table to the floor."
    "Fragmentos verdes de cristal roto: botellas de vino caídas de la mesa."

# game/a3s2.rpy:49
translate spanish a3s2_2cd28496:

    # "An ominous feeling starts to blossom in my chest as I note the purplish-red stains amongst the glass, the spilled wine dried from how long it's been there."
    "Una sensación ominosa nace en mi pecho al ver manchas de rojo purpúreo entre el cristal; el vino derramado se ha secado de tanto tiempo que lleva ahí."

# game/a3s2.rpy:50
translate spanish a3s2_b960b112:

    # "I swallow again to wet my throat, looking to the ceiling, about to call out to Com and ask for Neferu's location before stopping myself."
    "Vuelvo a tragar para humedecer la garganta y miro al techo, a punto de llamar a Com y preguntarle dónde está Neferu, pero me detengo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:51
translate spanish a3s2_eb9407b7:

    # "I don't know if actually alerting Com to my location is a good idea."
    "No sé si es buena idea alertar a Com de mi ubicación."

# game/a3s2.rpy:52
translate spanish a3s2_69e5f481:

    # "I'm pretty sure the security portion of the AI is separate from the rest of Com, but I don't want to chance it."
    "Estoy bastante seguro de que la parte de seguridad de la inteligencia artificial está separada del resto de Com, pero no quiero arriesgarme."

# game/a3s2.rpy:53
translate spanish a3s2_f3b4b92d:

    # "I stand there for a moment, unsure of what to do now."
    "Me quedo allí un momento, sin saber qué hacer."

# game/a3s2.rpy:54
translate spanish a3s2_269df705:

    # "I could go around the palace looking for the jackal."
    "Podría recorrer el palacio buscando al chacal."

# game/a3s2.rpy:55
translate spanish a3s2_21329e6f:

    # "He could be anywhere, really."
    "En realidad, podría estar en cualquier lugar."

# game/a3s2.rpy:56
translate spanish a3s2_d26e6b25:

    # "But seeing the glass, knowing what's happened..."
    "Pero viendo el cristal y sabiendo lo que ha ocurrido..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:57
translate spanish a3s2_695e2eb8:

    # "...I'm just denying what's obvious here."
    "...solo estoy negando lo evidente."

# game/a3s2.rpy:58
translate spanish a3s2_b9382c6c:

    # "I just have to hope that he's okay, wherever he's been taken."
    "Solo puedo esperar que esté bien, adondequiera que lo hayan llevado."

# game/a3s2.rpy:59
translate spanish a3s2_31312df0:

    # "I lean against the frame of the door for a moment, trying to think of what to do next."
    "Me apoyo un momento en el marco de la puerta, intentando pensar qué hacer después."

# game/a3s2.rpy:60
translate spanish a3s2_c54559de:

    # "I could look for Virginia, but I have no idea where her room might be."
    "Podría buscar a Virginia, pero no tengo ni idea de dónde está su habitación."

# game/a3s2.rpy:61
translate spanish a3s2_155652e7:

    # "Besides, if the state of Neferu's room is anything to go by, I wouldn't be surprised if she's been taken somewhere against her will as well."
    "Además, a juzgar por el estado de la habitación de Neferu, no me sorprendería que también se la hubieran llevado contra su voluntad."

# game/a3s2.rpy:62
translate spanish a3s2_4e0a377e:

    # "Cato probably knows everything about what we were planning."
    "Probablemente Cato sabe todo lo que planeábamos."

# game/a3s2.rpy:63
translate spanish a3s2_91fe0a61:

    # "There's really no other choice but to go into the dungeons, tell Amicus about what's happened, then maybe he'll know what to do."
    "No hay más opción que ir a los calabozos y contarle a Amicus lo ocurrido; quizá él sepa qué hacer."

# game/a3s2.rpy:64
translate spanish a3s2_7356fedf:

    # "Just as I'm turning to go back out into the hall though, I hear footsteps."
    "Pero, justo cuando voy a volver al pasillo, oigo pasos."

# game/a3s2.rpy:65
translate spanish a3s2_232d134f:

    # "I quickly draw back into the room, reaching up to the panel to shut the door again."
    "Retrocedo rápidamente hacia la habitación y extiendo una mano hacia el panel para cerrar la puerta."

# game/a3s2.rpy:66
translate spanish a3s2_19278696:

    # "Before I do though, I hear something else."
    "Antes de hacerlo oigo algo más."

# game/a3s2.rpy:67
translate spanish a3s2_3acaba53:

    # "The sound of muttering in a very familiar voice."
    "El sonido de una voz muy familiar murmurando."

# game/a3s2.rpy:68
translate spanish a3s2_3c33e14a:

    # "I linger just inside the room, listening as the voice draws closer."
    "Me quedo junto al interior de la puerta, escuchando cómo se acerca."

# game/a3s2.rpy:69
translate spanish a3s2_8698c218:

    # al "\"Oh dear, oh Galen, this is too much...too much!\""
    al "\"Ay, ay, Galen, esto es demasiado...¡demasiado!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:70
translate spanish a3s2_f0289194:

    # "I grit my teeth, listening as the cat comes closer, sounding like he's alone."
    "Aprieto los dientes, escuchando cómo se acerca el gato; parece estar solo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:71
translate spanish a3s2_b5c7d061:

    # "I suddenly make up my mind as to what I'm going to do next."
    "De pronto decido qué haré."

# game/a3s2.rpy:72
translate spanish a3s2_3d5134f1:

    # al "\"I'm going to be killed...I'm going to be killed...what was I THINKING!?\""
    al "\"Me van a matar...me van a matar...¿¡en qué estaba PENSANDO!?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:73
translate spanish a3s2_7c2aaa10:

    # "At that moment, the cat passes the doorway."
    "En ese momento el gato pasa por la puerta."

# game/a3s2.rpy:74
translate spanish a3s2_2b7ae484:

    # "He's got his paws up to the sides of his face, too busy staring at the ground to even notice me."
    "Tiene las manos a los lados de la cara y está tan ocupado mirando el suelo que ni me ve."

# game/a3s2.rpy:75
translate spanish a3s2_46330766:

    # "He's close enough that all I have to do is reach out and grab him by the straps of his robe before yanking him into the room as hard as I can."
    "Está tan cerca que solo debo alargar la mano y cogerlo por las tiras de la túnica antes de tirar de él hacia la habitación con todas mis fuerzas."

# game/a3s2.rpy:76
translate spanish a3s2_7e7b039b:

    # "Immediately, the cat shrieks, the sound bending comically with the force of my tug."
    "El gato chilla enseguida, con un sonido que se deforma cómicamente por la fuerza del tirón."

# game/a3s2.rpy:77
translate spanish a3s2_5421b0ec:

    # "I swing him around toward the middle of the room before turning around to quickly shut the door."
    "Lo lanzo hacia el centro de la habitación y me vuelvo para cerrar rápidamente la puerta."

# game/a3s2.rpy:79
translate spanish a3s2_b209fc99:

    # "Alex is still yelling as he tumbles to the ground, rolling several times before coming to a stop next to the shattered bottles."
    "Alex sigue gritando mientras cae al suelo y rueda varias veces antes de detenerse junto a las botellas rotas."

# game/a3s2.rpy:80
translate spanish a3s2_4a92119f:

    # "He curls up there, covering his face as he cowers on the ground."
    "Se encoge allí, cubriéndose la cara mientras se acobarda en el suelo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:82
translate spanish a3s2_90c786a4:

    # al "\"Wait! Wait! I'm sorry for whatever it is that I did!\""
    al "\"¡Espera! ¡Espera! ¡Lo siento por lo que sea que haya hecho!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:83
translate spanish a3s2_1b23529f:

    # "The cat continues to grovel before finally peeking through his paws to look up at me."
    "El gato sigue suplicando hasta que finalmente mira entre las manos hacia mí."

# game/a3s2.rpy:84
translate spanish a3s2_6d46b8c0:

    # "He goes quiet, though he remains fetal, as if deciding if he should still be scared or not."
    "Se calla, aunque sigue encogido como si decidiera si aún debe tener miedo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:85
translate spanish a3s2_50f2efd5:

    # "Suddenly, he seems to make up his mind and quickly stands, brushing off imaginary dust as he fixes his face into one of bland disinterest."
    "De pronto parece decidirse y se levanta rápidamente, sacudiéndose polvo imaginario mientras compone una expresión de indiferencia anodina."

# game/a3s2.rpy:87
translate spanish a3s2_6e43180a:

    # al "\"Oh [mc], I thought you might be someone else. My apologies.\""
    al "\"Oh, [mc], pensé que eras otra persona. Mis disculpas.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:88
translate spanish a3s2_c4ccab7b:

    # "I glare."
    "Lo miro con furia."

# game/a3s2.rpy:89
translate spanish a3s2_e26e214d:

    # al "\"What reason did you have for grabbing me so roughly?\""
    al "\"¿Qué motivo tenías para agarrarme con tanta brusquedad?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:90
translate spanish a3s2_320aabbf:

    # m "\"No, no more bullshitting from you. What the hell is going on?\""
    m "\"No, se acabaron tus mentiras. ¿Qué coño está pasando?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:91
translate spanish a3s2_c864a57f:

    # "The cat finally stops fidgeting and faces me, though he doesn't make eye contact, staring at the door behind me instead."
    "El gato deja por fin de moverse nervioso y se vuelve hacia mí, aunque no me mira a los ojos: mira la puerta detrás de mí."

# game/a3s2.rpy:93
translate spanish a3s2_d79c7294:

    # al "\"Well, I'm sure you already know that, don't you? I'm surprised Cato let you out, to be honest.\""
    al "\"Bueno, seguro que ya lo sabes, ¿no? Me sorprende que Cato te haya dejado salir, sinceramente.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:94
translate spanish a3s2_a4d4141c:

    # "Something about Alex's demeanor, not only the way he's acting now, but the way he's been acting for the past month, gets to me at that moment."
    "Algo en el comportamiento de Alex, tanto ahora como durante el último mes, me afecta en ese momento."

# game/a3s2.rpy:95
translate spanish a3s2_2d1c0daf:

    # "I step forward suddenly, and though I want to hit him, I settle with just giving him a hard shove in the chest that sends him stumbling back with a noisy slapping of his sandals on the stone floor."
    "Avanzo de pronto y, aunque quiero golpearlo, me limito a darle un fuerte empujón en el pecho que lo hace retroceder a trompicones, con las sandalias golpeando ruidosamente el suelo de piedra."

# game/a3s2.rpy:97
translate spanish a3s2_970112bd:

    # m "\"What the FUCK, Alex!?\""
    m "\"¿¡Qué COÑO, Alex!?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:99
translate spanish a3s2_286953c5:

    # "He windmills his arms, trying to catch his balance, and when he finally does, he brings his paws up to his chest, his ears pinned back and claws unsheathed."
    "Agita los brazos para recuperar el equilibrio; cuando lo consigue, alza las manos hasta el pecho, con las orejas hacia atrás y las garras fuera."

# game/a3s2.rpy:101
translate spanish a3s2_88d8708f:

    # "I don't know if Alex is any good at fighting, but I'd rather not get raked by those things, so I hold off on giving him another shove."
    "No sé si Alex sabe pelear, pero preferiría que no me arañara con esas cosas, así que evito volver a empujarlo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:102
translate spanish a3s2_4b3085a8:

    # "Besides, he's looking scared again, staring at me wide-eyed."
    "Además, vuelve a parecer asustado, mirándome con los ojos muy abiertos."

# game/a3s2.rpy:103
translate spanish a3s2_012f716c:

    # al "\"D—don't touch me!\""
    al "\"¡N-no me toques!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:104
translate spanish a3s2_52866265:

    # "I grit my teeth, forcing myself not to do it again."
    "Aprieto los dientes y me obligo a no hacerlo de nuevo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:105
translate spanish a3s2_a743a4d5:

    # m "\"Then tell me what it is that you're doing. Why did you do this?\""
    m "\"Entonces dime qué estás haciendo. ¿Por qué hiciste esto?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:106
translate spanish a3s2_07682022:

    # al "\"What?\""
    al "\"¿Qué?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:107
translate spanish a3s2_ab94b40b:

    # "This time I step forward and raise my fist threateningly, and immediately the cat covers his face, cowering."
    "Esta vez avanzo y levanto el puño amenazante; el gato se cubre la cara enseguida, acobardado."

# game/a3s2.rpy:109
translate spanish a3s2_5508eb66:

    # "I realize then that Alex probably doesn't have any fighting skills at all."
    "Entonces comprendo que Alex seguramente no sabe pelear en absoluto."

# game/a3s2.rpy:110
translate spanish a3s2_eb9a4e3b:

    # "That he might actually be a coward rather than just pretending to be one."
    "Que quizá sea un cobarde de verdad en lugar de fingirlo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:111
translate spanish a3s2_8ad74003:

    # "This realization cools my desire to really hurt the cat."
    "Esa revelación enfría mis ganas de hacerle daño."

# game/a3s2.rpy:112
translate spanish a3s2_17d554ad:

    # "Instead, I just wait again until Alex lowers his paw, looking at me with fear."
    "En cambio, vuelvo a esperar hasta que Alex baja la mano y me mira con miedo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:114
translate spanish a3s2_8235d688:

    # "I guess that's a good thing."
    "Supongo que es algo bueno."

# game/a3s2.rpy:115
translate spanish a3s2_b2eb0f6c:

    # "Amicus had told me in the past that the few sapient primates in the {i}Galaxias{/i} are really only known for a few things, one being that they can't swim, and the other being their incredible strength."
    "Amicus me dijo que los pocos primates sapientes del {i}Galaxias{/i} son conocidos por pocas cosas: una es que no saben nadar y otra, su fuerza increíble."

# game/a3s2.rpy:116
translate spanish a3s2_b30de4b9:

    # "I suppose it's a good reputation to have, even if it's not true for humans, but Alex wouldn't know that."
    "Supongo que es una buena fama, aunque no se aplique a los humanos; pero Alex no lo sabe."

# game/a3s2.rpy:117
translate spanish a3s2_1cfea481:

    # "I take another threatening step forward."
    "Avanzo otro paso amenazante."

# game/a3s2.rpy:118
translate spanish a3s2_b4db924c:

    # m "\"TELL me.\""
    m "\"DÍMELO.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:120
translate spanish a3s2_ea57d4e2:

    # al "\"Alright!\""
    al "\"¡Está bien!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:121
translate spanish a3s2_4c217d76:

    # "I'm surprised by the cat's sudden exclamation, his eyes screwed shut as he raises his paws to his head fur, tugging at it in distress."
    "Me sorprende la exclamación súbita del gato, que cierra los ojos con fuerza y se lleva las manos al pelo de la cabeza, tirando de él angustiado."

# game/a3s2.rpy:122
translate spanish a3s2_19fe6af8:

    # al "\"I'll tell you whatever it is you want if you just leave me alone! I'm tired of this goddamn palace and psychopathic wolves and half-developed children!\""
    al "\"¡Te diré lo que quieras si me dejas en paz! ¡Estoy harto de este maldito palacio, de lobos psicópatas y de Hijos a medio desarrollar!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:123
translate spanish a3s2_99acda89:

    # "I ignore that jab at me, staring at the cat, waiting."
    "Ignoro la pulla hacia mí y miro al gato, esperando."

# game/a3s2.rpy:125
translate spanish a3s2_17067b58:

    # al "\"I'll probably be deported soon anyway...if not executed.\""
    al "\"De todas formas, seguramente me deportarán pronto...si no me ejecutan.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:126
translate spanish a3s2_ce313bf6:

    # "The cat's voice catches in his throat, and he raises a paw to his mouth, seemingly about to cry again."
    "La voz del gato se atasca en la garganta; se lleva una mano a la boca y parece a punto de llorar otra vez."

# game/a3s2.rpy:127
translate spanish a3s2_2ec0b62d:

    # "He really is scared, and that gives me an idea."
    "De verdad tiene miedo, y eso me da una idea."

# game/a3s2.rpy:128
translate spanish a3s2_7e152af3:

    # m "\"Listen...I'm trying to help Amicus to his rightful place on the throne...maybe if you help me out, and Amicus does become emperor, I can work something out for you. You know how close the two of us are.\""
    m "\"Escucha...intento ayudar a Amicus a ocupar el lugar en el trono que le corresponde...quizá, si me ayudas y llega a ser emperador, pueda conseguir algo para ti. Sabes lo unidos que estamos.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:129
translate spanish a3s2_32f228cd:

    # "I wait as he tries to gather himself, clasping his paws together before simply looking at the ground."
    "Espero mientras intenta serenarse, juntando las manos antes de mirar simplemente el suelo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:130
translate spanish a3s2_bf2d8c8f:

    # "He doesn't say anything though, so I sigh."
    "Pero no dice nada, así que suspiro."

# game/a3s2.rpy:131
translate spanish a3s2_cd3021fa:

    # m "\"Why did you tell Cato about our plan?\""
    m "\"¿Por qué le contaste a Cato nuestro plan?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:132
translate spanish a3s2_cfbd01f4:

    # "Alex echoes my sigh, looking away off to the side."
    "Alex también suspira y aparta la mirada hacia un lado."

# game/a3s2.rpy:133
translate spanish a3s2_e08eb924:

    # al "\"I—there's a lot of {i}Galaxias{/i} politics that you wouldn't understand [mc]—\""
    al "\"Yo...hay mucha política del {i}Galaxias{/i} que no entenderías, [mc]—\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:134
translate spanish a3s2_10cf3c82:

    # m "\"Well, simplify it for me, then. I might be 'half-developed', but I think I'm starting to get the hang of how things work around here.\""
    m "\"Pues simplifícamela. Puede que esté 'a medio desarrollar', pero creo que empiezo a comprender cómo funcionan las cosas aquí.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:135
translate spanish a3s2_1e3ef232:

    # al "\"A—And if I tell you, you'll help me leave this cursed moon?\""
    al "\"¿Y-y si te lo cuento, me ayudarás a salir de esta luna maldita?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:136
translate spanish a3s2_b9634b62:

    # "I grit my teeth."
    "Aprieto los dientes."

# game/a3s2.rpy:137
translate spanish a3s2_662f576d:

    # m "\"...Yes.\""
    m "\"...Sí.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:138
translate spanish a3s2_c9ec6347:

    # "Alex side-eyes me before shaking his head."
    "Alex me mira de reojo antes de negar con la cabeza."

# game/a3s2.rpy:139
translate spanish a3s2_143be026:

    # al "\"I was...I became a pet for a single reason, not for ambassadorial, or Adastra-Omorfa relations...not even to gather intelligence—\""
    al "\"Yo era...me convertí en mascota por una sola razón, no por labores de embajador ni por las relaciones entre Adastra y Omorfa...ni siquiera para recopilar información—\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:140
translate spanish a3s2_b17b4394:

    # al "\"I mean, originally that {i}was{/i} my purpose, but I became close to Cassius over the course of several official meetings and dinners.\""
    al "\"Quiero decir que al principio {i}ese{/i} era mi propósito, pero me acerqué a Cassius durante varias reuniones y cenas oficiales.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:141
translate spanish a3s2_724233aa:

    # al "\"My department took notice and...and altered my assignment.\""
    al "\"Mi departamento se dio cuenta y...y cambió mi misión.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:142
translate spanish a3s2_3b04986a:

    # "The cat goes quiet again."
    "El gato vuelve a callarse."

# game/a3s2.rpy:143
translate spanish a3s2_a14c428f:

    # m "\"Alright, then what are you here for now?\""
    m "\"Bien, entonces ¿para qué estás aquí ahora?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:144
translate spanish a3s2_6a67dd63:

    # "Alex takes a deep breath and looks me in the eye."
    "Alex respira hondo y me mira a los ojos."

# game/a3s2.rpy:146
translate spanish a3s2_8d83c325:

    # al "\"Chaos.\""
    al "\"Caos.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:147
translate spanish a3s2_523b0150:

    # "I wait, but that's all the cat says."
    "Espero, pero el gato no añade nada."

# game/a3s2.rpy:148
translate spanish a3s2_7b219b50:

    # "I frown at him."
    "Lo miro con el ceño fruncido."

# game/a3s2.rpy:149
translate spanish a3s2_ffdf8af8:

    # m "\"You're...here to create chaos?\""
    m "\"¿Estás...aquí para crear caos?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:150
translate spanish a3s2_cab3a825:

    # "Alex's voice suddenly becomes monotonous."
    "La voz de Alex se vuelve monótona de repente."

# game/a3s2.rpy:151
translate spanish a3s2_06fb2a97:

    # al "\"An unstable government creates an unstable society.\""
    al "\"Un gobierno inestable crea una sociedad inestable.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:152
translate spanish a3s2_f8d2684f:

    # al "\"Progress is stalled and outward endeavors turn inward. The society worries less about what is happening outside their borders while becoming more concerned with their own issues.\""
    al "\"El progreso se detiene y los esfuerzos exteriores se vuelven hacia dentro. La sociedad se preocupa menos por lo que pasa fuera de sus fronteras y más por sus propios problemas.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:153
translate spanish a3s2_e049a2c4:

    # "It's like he's reciting something that he's heard many times before."
    "Es como si recitara algo que ha oído muchas veces."

# game/a3s2.rpy:154
translate spanish a3s2_bcb6de31:

    # "Thinking about it, the explanation seems to have some reason to it."
    "Pensándolo, la explicación parece tener algo de lógica."

# game/a3s2.rpy:155
translate spanish a3s2_8410ec63:

    # "Alex's seemingly senseless decisions, shifting alliances, and general odd behavior could be explained by this."
    "Eso explicaría las decisiones aparentemente absurdas de Alex, sus alianzas cambiantes y su extraño comportamiento general."

# game/a3s2.rpy:156
translate spanish a3s2_774a1489:

    # "He's only here to make things more difficult for the wolves to integrate back into the {i}Galaxias{/i}."
    "Solo está aquí para dificultar la reintegración de los lobos en el {i}Galaxias{/i}."

# game/a3s2.rpy:157
translate spanish a3s2_ddea01e4:

    # "To prevent them from progressing out of the technological and economic slump they're currently in."
    "Para impedir que salgan del estancamiento tecnológico y económico en el que se encuentran."

# game/a3s2.rpy:158
translate spanish a3s2_0c841c76:

    # "He's not just against me, Amicus, Cassius, or even Cato, but rather all of us at once."
    "No está contra mí, Amicus, Cassius o incluso Cato, sino contra todos a la vez."

# game/a3s2.rpy:159
translate spanish a3s2_404cf934:

    # "I think about the billowing smoke over Adastra City, what's probably happening to dozens of cities right now, and I suddenly feel an overwhelming feeling of disgust for the cat in front of me."
    "Pienso en el humo que se eleva sobre la ciudad de Adastra, en lo que probablemente ocurre ahora en docenas de ciudades, y de pronto siento un asco abrumador por el gato que tengo delante."

# game/a3s2.rpy:160
translate spanish a3s2_be47c7b4:

    # "A lot of things have happened on this moon that bothered me, but this particular act of sabotage is probably the worst."
    "Han ocurrido muchas cosas en esta luna que me molestaron, pero este acto de sabotaje es seguramente la peor."

# game/a3s2.rpy:161
translate spanish a3s2_677b3f44:

    # "Just something about how careless it is; not knowing what will even happen, just that it will hurt the empire, the people..."
    "Hay algo en su descuido: ni siquiera saber qué ocurrirá, solo que dañará al imperio, a la gente..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:162
translate spanish a3s2_810561d5:

    # "Alex sees the look on my face and quickly takes a step back, looking away."
    "Alex ve mi expresión y retrocede rápidamente, apartando la mirada."

# game/a3s2.rpy:164
translate spanish a3s2_2647b40c:

    # al "\"I understand that it may seem harsh, but it is my duty to Omorfa and the {i}Galaxias{/i} as a whole to keep us safe from Adastra. You...if you knew the history—\""
    al "\"Entiendo que pueda parecer duro, pero es mi deber con Omorfa y con todo el {i}Galaxias{/i} protegernos de Adastra. Tú...si conocieras la historia—\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:165
translate spanish a3s2_c377a3f9:

    # m "\"I assume you started the rumors about the triumvirates, then pinned it on me?\""
    m "\"Supongo que empezaste los rumores sobre los triunviros y después me echaste la culpa, ¿no?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:166
translate spanish a3s2_720ccd1d:

    # al "\"I—I...I may have started the rumors, but I never implicated you.\""
    al "\"Y-yo...puede que empezara los rumores, pero nunca te impliqué.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:167
translate spanish a3s2_20152a99:

    # m "\"But you knew that would happen.\""
    m "\"Pero sabías que pasaría.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:169
translate spanish a3s2_6039ec26:

    # "Alex opens his mouth, then shuts it, looking away again."
    "Alex abre la boca y después la cierra, apartando de nuevo la mirada."

# game/a3s2.rpy:170
translate spanish a3s2_b0af2403:

    # m "\"And after I woke up in the gardens, told you about the doctor...you probably told Cato about our relationship then, too.\""
    m "\"Y después de que despertara en los jardines y te contara lo del médico...probablemente también le contaste a Cato lo nuestro.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:171
translate spanish a3s2_7d3d6bc4:

    # "Alex frowns deeply, taking another step back, looking almost like a child that got caught doing something wrong."
    "Alex frunce mucho el ceño y retrocede otro paso, casi como un niño al que pillaron haciendo algo malo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:172
translate spanish a3s2_0c51b4d9:

    # "I feel my face grow hot, not really confident anymore that I'll be able to hold myself back from caving this cat's face in."
    "Siento calentarse mi cara; ya no estoy tan seguro de poder contenerme y no destrozarle la cara a este gato."

# game/a3s2.rpy:173
translate spanish a3s2_027658fd:

    # "Maybe later...but this isn't important right now, even if this creature in front of me is responsible for half my troubles...if not all of them."
    "Quizá más tarde...pero ahora no es importante, aunque esta criatura sea responsable de la mitad de mis problemas...si no de todos."

# game/a3s2.rpy:174
translate spanish a3s2_f49d5750:

    # m "\"Where is Neferu, or Virginia?\""
    m "\"¿Dónde están Neferu o Virginia?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:175
translate spanish a3s2_58f10677:

    # "Alex looks surprised for a moment at the sudden shift in conversation."
    "Alex parece sorprendido un momento por el cambio repentino de conversación."

# game/a3s2.rpy:177
translate spanish a3s2_6d8e5927:

    # al "\"Well...Virginia is to be married to Cato later today—\""
    al "\"Bueno...Virginia se casará con Cato más tarde hoy—\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:178
translate spanish a3s2_23d497b0:

    # "My stomach lurches at that, but before I can even start to comprehend what that means, Alex goes on."
    "Mi estómago se revuelve, pero, antes de que pueda comprender lo que significa, Alex continúa."

# game/a3s2.rpy:179
translate spanish a3s2_2e864f09:

    # al "\"As for Neferu, well...you don't know?\""
    al "\"En cuanto a Neferu...¿no lo sabes?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:180
translate spanish a3s2_b0b73cf7:

    # m "\"I've been locked in Amicus's room all day. I don't know anything.\""
    m "\"Llevo todo el día encerrado en la habitación de Amicus. No sé nada.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:182
translate spanish a3s2_e450bce4:

    # al "\"Ah well...Neferu is scheduled to be executed, I think...\""
    al "\"Ah, bueno...está previsto que ejecuten a Neferu, creo...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:183
translate spanish a3s2_61f958ee:

    # "I stare."
    "Me quedo mirándolo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:184
translate spanish a3s2_c58b903c:

    # m "\"What, when!?\""
    m "\"¿¡Qué, cuándo!?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:185
translate spanish a3s2_69c6cd3a:

    # al "\"I—I'm not completely sure, I woke up alone in the dining room and saw it on the news channels.\""
    al "\"Y-yo no estoy del todo seguro; desperté solo en el comedor y lo vi en los canales de noticias.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:186
translate spanish a3s2_f6b8c2db:

    # m "\"No, when is he being executed?\""
    m "\"No, ¿cuándo van a ejecutarlo?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:187
translate spanish a3s2_92130bdc:

    # al "\"I don't know...it was going to be sometime today.\""
    al "\"No sé...iba a ser en algún momento de hoy.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:188
translate spanish a3s2_b31da6f2:

    # m "\"But it hasn't happened yet, right!?\""
    m "\"Pero todavía no ha pasado, ¿¡verdad!?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:189
translate spanish a3s2_f857b67c:

    # al "\"I—I—I don't kn—\""
    al "\"Y-y-yo no sé—\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:190
translate spanish a3s2_e51ada2b:

    # m "\"COM!\""
    m "\"¡COM!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:191
translate spanish a3s2_2c106473:

    # "I cut Alex off, not caring anymore about alerting Com to my location."
    "Interrumpo a Alex; ya no me importa alertar a Com de dónde estoy."

# game/a3s2.rpy:192
translate spanish a3s2_80cf3baf:

    # com "\"Yes, [mc]?\""
    com "\"¿Sí, [mc]?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:193
translate spanish a3s2_40983d7c:

    # m "\"Has Neferu been executed?\""
    m "\"¿Han ejecutado a Neferu?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:194
translate spanish a3s2_f85b39eb:

    # "There's a pause."
    "Se hace una pausa."

# game/a3s2.rpy:195
translate spanish a3s2_1899e8fa:

    # "For a moment, all I can hear is my heartbeat hammering in my ears, and for a surreal moment, I feel like I'm going to pass out and I have to square my stance to make sure I don't go falling over."
    "Por un momento solo oigo mi corazón martilleándome los oídos; en un instante irreal siento que voy a desmayarme y debo plantar bien los pies para no caer."

# game/a3s2.rpy:196
translate spanish a3s2_d23cf1a0:

    # "The pause seems longer than normal, like Com is having trouble finding the information that I asked for, then—"
    "La pausa parece más larga de lo normal, como si a Com le costara encontrar la información que pedí, y entonces—"

# game/a3s2.rpy:197
translate spanish a3s2_8a2db982:

    # com "\"Here's what I found: The execution of Neferu, the Pharaoh's second son, is to take place in the royal amphitheater on the fourteenth hour for crimes of espionage and conspiracy to murder Emperor Cassius.\""
    com "\"Esto es lo que encontré: la ejecución de Neferu, segundo hijo del Faraón, tendrá lugar en el anfiteatro real a la decimocuarta hora, por delitos de espionaje y conspiración para asesinar al emperador Cassius.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:198
translate spanish a3s2_08902ebb:

    # com "\"The execution will be broadcast live on all public—\""
    com "\"La ejecución se transmitirá en directo en todos los canales públicos—\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:199
translate spanish a3s2_28130a5b:

    # m "\"How much time until the fourteen hour!?\""
    m "\"¿¡Cuánto falta para la decimocuarta hora!?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:200
translate spanish a3s2_3c069ce5:

    # com "\"Fourteen minutes and thirty-one seconds.\""
    com "\"Catorce minutos y treinta y un segundos.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:201
translate spanish a3s2_d5af6f0b:

    # m "\"SHIT!\""
    m "\"¡MIERDA!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:202
translate spanish a3s2_4d988ae3:

    # "What the hell am I supposed to do?"
    "¿Qué demonios se supone que debo hacer?"

# game/a3s2.rpy:203
translate spanish a3s2_f4577c80:

    # "That's not enough time at all."
    "No es tiempo suficiente en absoluto."

# game/a3s2.rpy:204
translate spanish a3s2_668d1a7e:

    # "Even if I can get to Amicus, I can't get him out in time before—\""
    "Aunque pueda llegar hasta Amicus, no puedo sacarlo a tiempo antes de—\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:205
translate spanish a3s2_c6594127:

    # mon "\"{cps=20}{i}...the cat...{/i}\""
    mon "\"{cps=20}{i}...el gato...{/i}\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:206
translate spanish a3s2_97c23fc1:

    # "I turn my eyes on Alex, and he immediately backs away again, trembling."
    "Miro a Alex y él vuelve a retroceder enseguida, temblando."

# game/a3s2.rpy:208
translate spanish a3s2_c966f924:

    # m "\"Can you get Amicus out of the dungeons?\""
    m "\"¿Puedes sacar a Amicus de los calabozos?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:209
translate spanish a3s2_b61e2ccf:

    # al "\"I—I—\""
    al "\"Y-yo—\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:210
translate spanish a3s2_e3f2572c:

    # "In that moment I almost slap him, but I stubbornly force my shaking hands to stay at my sides."
    "En ese momento casi le doy una bofetada, pero me obligo a mantener mis manos temblorosas a los lados."

# game/a3s2.rpy:211
translate spanish a3s2_04306acf:

    # m "\"Can you fucking get him out, or not?\""
    m "\"¿Puedes sacarlo, joder, o no?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:213
translate spanish a3s2_4ce1a903:

    # al "\"I...think so. Cassius gave me almost unlimited access to Com's security—\""
    al "\"Yo...creo que sí. Cassius me dio acceso casi ilimitado a la seguridad de Com—\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:214
translate spanish a3s2_e0aa8397:

    # "My heart leaps in my chest."
    "El corazón me salta en el pecho."

# game/a3s2.rpy:215
translate spanish a3s2_e04afe8e:

    # m "\"Then let's go down there and get him the hell out.\""
    m "\"Entonces bajemos y saquémoslo de una puta vez.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:216
translate spanish a3s2_4ab29769:

    # "I turn to the door, but notice Alex is still frozen in the same place."
    "Me vuelvo hacia la puerta, pero veo que Alex sigue inmóvil en el mismo sitio."

# game/a3s2.rpy:217
translate spanish a3s2_244bb5cf:

    # "The look on my face makes him cringe again."
    "Mi expresión vuelve a hacerlo encogerse."

# game/a3s2.rpy:218
translate spanish a3s2_c2b14ef7:

    # al "\"Y—yes, but...you won't let him imprison, or execute me if I do?\""
    al "\"S-sí, pero...¿no dejarás que me encarcele o ejecute si lo hago?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:219
translate spanish a3s2_14d2f43a:

    # m "\"Alex...{i}I{/i} will kill you right now if you don't fucking do what I tell you!\""
    m "\"Alex...¡{i}yo{/i} te mataré ahora mismo si no haces lo que te digo, joder!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:221
translate spanish a3s2_75130942:

    # "The cat jumps and yelps as I scream at him, scrambling to head out the door with me hot on his heels."
    "El gato salta y chilla cuando le grito; sale apresuradamente por la puerta conmigo pegado a sus talones."

# game/a3s2.rpy:223
translate spanish a3s2_87e55253:

    # "The cat was at least right about one thing:"
    "Al menos tenía razón en una cosa:"

# game/a3s2.rpy:224
translate spanish a3s2_1cf0169f:

    # "I would never be able to be a \"diplomat\" if that's what he really is."
    "Nunca podría ser un \"diplomático\", si eso es lo que es de verdad."

# game/a3s2.rpy:227
translate spanish a3s2_a6d066fc:

    # "I follow as closely to the cat as possible, practically stepping on his heels."
    "Sigo al gato todo lo cerca que puedo, casi pisándole los talones."

# game/a3s2.rpy:228
translate spanish a3s2_c0212502:

    # "Alex is clearly aware of it as his ears twitch back and forth nervously, trying to inconspicuously glance back at me every now and then."
    "Alex es claramente consciente: sus orejas se mueven nerviosas de un lado a otro y trata de mirarme disimuladamente de vez en cuando."

# game/a3s2.rpy:229
translate spanish a3s2_c8451925:

    # "Halfway to the dungeons though, the PSA system crackles over our heads."
    "Pero, a mitad de camino a los calabozos, el sistema de megafonía crepita sobre nuestras cabezas."

# game/a3s2.rpy:230
translate spanish a3s2_da77757e:

    # com "\"Citizens of Adastra; please prepare for an imperial address by Emperor Cato.\""
    com "\"Ciudadanos de Adastra: preparaos para un discurso imperial del emperador Cato.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:231
translate spanish a3s2_bbd5ce9a:

    # "Alex looks back, but I force him to keep going with some prodding in his back, praying that maybe this won't have to do with the execution, or that Cato might be canceling it all together."
    "Alex mira atrás, pero lo obligo a seguir con empujones en la espalda, rogando que quizá no tenga que ver con la ejecución o que Cato vaya a cancelarla por completo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:232
translate spanish a3s2_c9f4c331:

    # "Of course, that's not the case."
    "Por supuesto, no es así."

# game/a3s2.rpy:233
translate spanish a3s2_4797ebe1:

    # ca "\"Citizens, it is a momentous day in the long history of our glorious moon.\""
    ca "\"Ciudadanos, es un día trascendental en la larga historia de nuestra gloriosa luna.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:234
translate spanish a3s2_9282a4d5:

    # "I shove at Alex's back again."
    "Vuelvo a empujar a Alex por la espalda."

# game/a3s2.rpy:235
translate spanish a3s2_b0eaf731:

    # m "\"Just run.\""
    m "\"Solo corre.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:236
translate spanish a3s2_be1a7434:

    # "Alex does as he's told, though it's still not as fast as I'd like to go."
    "Alex obedece, aunque sigue sin ir tan rápido como me gustaría."

# game/a3s2.rpy:237
translate spanish a3s2_94d6b49d:

    # ca "\"After 10,000 years, we are finally choosing our own path, we are taking control of our destiny.\""
    ca "\"Después de diez mil años, por fin elegimos nuestro propio camino y tomamos las riendas de nuestro destino.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:238
translate spanish a3s2_86a6bfd9:

    # "I'm beginning to realize that after waiting for so long, unsure of what my own destiny might be..."
    "Empiezo a comprender que, después de esperar tanto sin saber cuál sería mi destino..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:239
translate spanish a3s2_dcd401e7:

    # "...It's going to be decided today, no matter what the outcome might be."
    "...se decidirá hoy, sea cual sea el desenlace."

# game/a3s2.rpy:240
translate spanish a3s2_f67941bd:

    # ca "\"And that begins with showing our fellow siblings that we will no longer tolerate their belittling, their false sense of superiority, their arrogance...\""
    ca "\"Y eso empieza por mostrar a nuestros Hermanos que ya no toleraremos su desprecio, su falsa superioridad, su arrogancia...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:241
translate spanish a3s2_20b2dfa5:

    # "Alex and I come up on the door that leads down to the dungeon and the cat awkwardly starts climbing down the ladder, having a great deal of trouble with his robes."
    "Alex y yo llegamos a la puerta de los calabozos; el gato empieza a bajar torpemente por la escalera de mano, con grandes dificultades por la túnica."

# game/a3s2.rpy:242
translate spanish a3s2_d86acbfb:

    # ca "\"...and we especially will not tolerate spies, which I have kneeling before me as I speak.\""
    ca "\"...y especialmente no toleraremos espías, como el que tengo arrodillado ante mí mientras hablo.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:243
translate spanish a3s2_e702aa93:

    # m "\"Hurry!\""
    m "\"¡Date prisa!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:244
translate spanish a3s2_0544400d:

    # "I yell at the cat as I start sliding down the ladder myself, almost knocking him off as we reach the ground at almost the same time."
    "Le grito al gato mientras me deslizo por la escalera; casi lo derribo al llegar al suelo prácticamente a la vez."

# game/a3s2.rpy:245
translate spanish a3s2_71b36a99:

    # ca "\"The Offerer of False Alliances, The Whore of Jackals, The Flower of Khemia...\""
    ca "\"El Oferente de Falsas Alianzas, la Puta de los Chacales, la Flor de Khemia...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:247
translate spanish a3s2_41183a46:

    # "I follow the stumbling cat through the musty hall of the dungeon, never having been in this deep before considering my meetings with Amicus had to take place near the entrance."
    "Sigo al gato tambaleante por el pasillo mohoso del calabozo; nunca había entrado tan adentro, porque mis encuentros con Amicus tenían que ser cerca de la entrada."

# game/a3s2.rpy:248
translate spanish a3s2_4505f7e7:

    # "We reach a cell door, and Alex presses a paw to a panel on the wall; a beige, marble slab rather than the more glossy, black panels above."
    "Llegamos a la puerta de una celda y Alex apoya una mano en un panel de la pared: una losa de mármol beige en lugar de los paneles negros y brillantes de arriba."

# game/a3s2.rpy:251
translate spanish a3s2_995121a5:

    # "It opens to a small, cramped cell; a bed in one corner, a sink, toilet, and tiny shower in another, and what looks like a desk near the door."
    "Se abre una celda pequeña y estrecha: una cama en una esquina, un lavabo, un retrete y una ducha diminuta en otra, y algo parecido a un escritorio junto a la puerta."

# game/a3s2.rpy:252
translate spanish a3s2_159ba207:

    # "Amicus is in the bed, curled up on his side, facing away from us."
    "Amicus está en la cama, acurrucado de lado y de espaldas a nosotros."

# game/a3s2.rpy:253
translate spanish a3s2_0c416389:

    # m "\"Amicus!\""
    m "\"¡Amicus!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:254
translate spanish a3s2_7b71801e:

    # "I shove roughly past Alex, sending him to smack face-first against the doorframe with a yelp."
    "Paso bruscamente junto a Alex y lo hago golpearse de cara contra el marco de la puerta, con un chillido."

# game/a3s2.rpy:255
translate spanish a3s2_266e20f7:

    # "The big wolf starts to stir before I reach him and throw my arms over him."
    "El gran lobo empieza a moverse antes de que llegue hasta él y lo rodee con los brazos."

# game/a3s2.rpy:256
translate spanish a3s2_81877ec5:

    # "I feel him jump underneath me, and I know I've just woken him up."
    "Lo siento sobresaltarse debajo de mí y sé que acabo de despertarlo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:257
translate spanish a3s2_50118255:

    # "He turns his head to look at me."
    "Gira la cabeza para mirarme."

# game/a3s2.rpy:259
translate spanish a3s2_804cd142:

    # a "\"[mc]?\""
    a "\"¿[mc]?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:260
translate spanish a3s2_8cccba06:

    # "He sits up against my hugging, automatically wrapping his arms around me."
    "Se incorpora contra mi abrazo y me rodea automáticamente con los brazos."

# game/a3s2.rpy:261
translate spanish a3s2_83189111:

    # a "\"Wait, how did you—\""
    a "\"Espera, ¿cómo has—\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:262
translate spanish a3s2_21e22be7:

    # "He looks over my shoulder."
    "Mira por encima de mi hombro."

# game/a3s2.rpy:263
translate spanish a3s2_b5fa7963:

    # a "\"Alex?\""
    a "\"¿Alex?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:264
translate spanish a3s2_efb11699:

    # m "\"Amicus! Cato is emperor, he's about to execute Neferu, you need to—\""
    m "\"¡Amicus! Cato es el emperador y está a punto de ejecutar a Neferu; tienes que—\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:265
translate spanish a3s2_f23bb97a:

    # "I choke on my words, only now feeling the weight of the information I'm just dropping on Amicus right now."
    "Las palabras se me atascan; solo ahora siento el peso de la información que acabo de soltarle a Amicus."

# game/a3s2.rpy:266
translate spanish a3s2_e77f77ce:

    # m "\"—you need to challenge him to combat.\""
    m "\"—tienes que retarlo a un combate.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:267
translate spanish a3s2_edda0881:

    # "I surprise myself as I suddenly start to cry, realizing my own words as I say them."
    "Me sorprendo al empezar a llorar de pronto, comprendiendo mis propias palabras mientras las digo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:268
translate spanish a3s2_d57a462c:

    # "In that moment, I can see all the confusion, bewilderment, and shock in my wolf's face, his mouth hanging open just slightly."
    "En ese instante veo toda la confusión, el desconcierto y el impacto en la cara de mi lobo, con la boca ligeramente abierta."

# game/a3s2.rpy:269
translate spanish a3s2_593b2212:

    # "He probably wants to ask me a million questions, but in that space of a few seconds, I see his expression set into one of serious determination."
    "Probablemente quiere hacerme un millón de preguntas, pero en esos pocos segundos veo cómo su expresión se transforma en una determinación seria."

# game/a3s2.rpy:271
translate spanish a3s2_09a1342d:

    # a "\"Alright. Where is he?\""
    a "\"De acuerdo. ¿Dónde está?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:272
translate spanish a3s2_234acae2:

    # "The sudden shift from confusion to a sense of duty and confidence actually stops my crying, even as the first tears spill over."
    "El cambio repentino de confusión a deber y confianza detiene mi llanto, incluso mientras se derraman las primeras lágrimas."

# game/a3s2.rpy:273
translate spanish a3s2_5547f7e4:

    # m "\"The—the amphitheater, it's happening right now."
    m "\"El...el anfiteatro; está pasando ahora mismo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:275
translate spanish a3s2_9b471f43:

    # "For just a moment, the wolf continues to hold me, wipes a tear away with his thumb, then gently moves me aside as he swings his legs over the edge of the bed."
    "Por un momento, el lobo sigue abrazándome, me seca una lágrima con el pulgar y después me aparta suavemente mientras pasa las piernas por el borde de la cama."

# game/a3s2.rpy:277
translate spanish a3s2_2049e238:

    # a "\"Alex, can I leave the dungeon?\""
    a "\"Alex, ¿puedo salir del calabozo?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:279
translate spanish a3s2_a0d2b4d2:

    # al "\"Um...Com...let Amicus leave the dungeons...please?\""
    al "\"Eh...Com...deja que Amicus salga de los calabozos...¿por favor?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:280
translate spanish a3s2_fea2c737:

    # "Alex looks up at the ceiling, clearly unsure of what he's doing."
    "Alex mira al techo, claramente inseguro de lo que hace."

# game/a3s2.rpy:281
translate spanish a3s2_3730bbae:

    # com "\"Shall I remove Amicus from the prisoner list, Alex?\""
    com "\"¿Debo quitar a Amicus de la lista de presos, Alex?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:282
translate spanish a3s2_0c8b9bfb:

    # al "\"Uh...yes.\""
    al "\"Eh...sí.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:283
translate spanish a3s2_bd864ece:

    # com "\"It is done.\""
    com "\"Está hecho.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:284
translate spanish a3s2_8292f83e:

    # "At that moment, I suddenly realize then that Cato isn't being broadcast down here."
    "En ese momento me doy cuenta de pronto de que aquí abajo no se transmite a Cato."

# game/a3s2.rpy:285
translate spanish a3s2_363658d3:

    # "I don't even know if the execution has been carried out yet or not."
    "Ni siquiera sé si la ejecución ya se ha llevado a cabo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:286
translate spanish a3s2_ff77a760:

    # "Amicus hops off the bed."
    "Amicus salta de la cama."

# game/a3s2.rpy:287
translate spanish a3s2_ed4fa451:

    # a "\"Alright, we must move!\""
    a "\"¡Bien, debemos movernos!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:291
translate spanish a3s2_698e87b1:

    # "This time, Alex is knocked on his ass as Amicus practically steamrolls him on his way out the door."
    "Esta vez Alex cae de culo cuando Amicus prácticamente lo arrolla al salir por la puerta."

# game/a3s2.rpy:292
translate spanish a3s2_5721aee3:

    # "I jump over the cat as I follow the wolf."
    "Salto por encima del gato mientras sigo al lobo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:293
translate spanish a3s2_eb94c7d5:

    # "Though much bigger, Amicus is still just slightly faster than I am as I sprint after him, his thundering footfalls echoing through the halls."
    "Aunque es mucho más grande, Amicus sigue siendo un poco más rápido que yo; corro tras él mientras sus pasos atronadores resuenan por los pasillos."

# game/a3s2.rpy:294
translate spanish a3s2_c19c2800:

    # "He yells back at me as I follow."
    "Me grita hacia atrás mientras lo sigo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:295
translate spanish a3s2_08bd6497:

    # a "\"What of Cassius!?\""
    a "\"¿¡Qué pasa con Cassius!?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:296
translate spanish a3s2_d3df92d3:

    # m "\"Poisoned! He's...I don't know what his condition is right now!\""
    m "\"¡Envenenado! Está...¡no sé cuál es su estado ahora!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:297
translate spanish a3s2_2ab864d8:

    # "I gasp out the answer and I can't see his face as Amicus is silent, continuing to run."
    "Jadeo la respuesta y no puedo verle la cara; Amicus sigue corriendo en silencio."

# game/a3s2.rpy:298
translate spanish a3s2_19e9c823:

    # "We reach the ladder and Amicus somehow climbs the thing with three gigantic lunges, skipping several rungs at a time."
    "Llegamos a la escalera y Amicus la sube de alguna forma en tres enormes impulsos, saltándose varios peldaños a la vez."

# game/a3s2.rpy:299
translate spanish a3s2_5a6509c2:

    # "By the time I reach the top, he's already out of sight."
    "Cuando llego arriba, ya lo he perdido de vista."

# game/a3s2.rpy:301
translate spanish a3s2_3096afa9:

    # ca "\"So now, let this be a warning to Khemia, or any other sibling race...\""
    ca "\"Que esto sirva de advertencia a Khemia o a cualquier otra raza Hermana...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:303
translate spanish a3s2_519b54b4:

    # "I run out into the gardens, in the direction of the amphitheater."
    "Salgo corriendo a los jardines, hacia el anfiteatro."

# game/a3s2.rpy:304
translate spanish a3s2_8fe5b8b1:

    # "I just catch sight of Amicus's tail as it disappears around some trees, down the trail that leads to where Cato should be."
    "Apenas veo la cola de Amicus desaparecer entre unos árboles, por el sendero que lleva adonde debe estar Cato."

# game/a3s2.rpy:305
translate spanish a3s2_9c601979:

    # ca "\"We will not hesitate to eliminate you if you meddle in our matters!\""
    ca "\"¡No dudaremos en eliminaros si os entrometéis en nuestros asuntos!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:306
translate spanish a3s2_6ab9e98c:

    # "There's a sense of finality to those words, and I know that we're out of time."
    "Esas palabras suenan definitivas, y sé que ya no nos queda tiempo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:307
translate spanish a3s2_0a423a18:

    # "I'm on the path to the amphitheater, and though it only takes a few seconds to make it to the end, it feels like an eternity."
    "Estoy en el sendero al anfiteatro; aunque solo se tarda unos segundos en llegar al final, me parece una eternidad."

# game/a3s2.rpy:308
translate spanish a3s2_13c0da5f:

    # mon "\"{cps=20}{i}You are on the right path...{/i}\""
    mon "\"{cps=20}{i}Estás en el camino correcto...{/i}\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:310
translate spanish a3s2_f795555d:

    # "I burst through into the clearing of the amphitheater just as I hear Amicus yell."
    "Irrumpo en el claro del anfiteatro justo cuando oigo gritar a Amicus."

# game/a3s2.rpy:311
translate spanish a3s2_040a7580:

    # a "\"STOP!\""
    a "\"¡ALTO!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:313
translate spanish a3s2_1a95f15c:

    # "I look down the steps to see my wolf standing at the base of the stairs, his paws out wide, standing in front of Neferu and Cato."
    "Miro hacia abajo por los escalones y veo a mi lobo al pie de la escalera, con las manos extendidas, delante de Neferu y Cato."

# game/a3s2.rpy:314
translate spanish a3s2_bf6e645d:

    # "The jackal is knelt on the ground, his paws restrained behind his back somehow, a look of dazed, disbelief on his face."
    "El chacal está arrodillado en el suelo, con las manos sujetas de algún modo detrás de la espalda y una expresión aturdida e incrédula."

# game/a3s2.rpy:315
translate spanish a3s2_c680dce3:

    # "His face is forced to look up because Cato has a hold of his head fur, tilting the jackal's head up so that his neck is fully exposed."
    "Lo obligan a mirar hacia arriba porque Cato lo sujeta del pelo de la cabeza, inclinándosela para dejar el cuello completamente expuesto."

# game/a3s2.rpy:316
translate spanish a3s2_33718240:

    # "In Cato's other massive paw is a shiny, gold, decorative dagger, and it's just inches away from Neferu's neck."
    "En la otra enorme mano de Cato hay un puñal decorativo de oro brillante, a pocos centímetros del cuello de Neferu."

# game/a3s2.rpy:317
translate spanish a3s2_6c7a435c:

    # "Meanwhile, directly across from me, sitting in front of the statue of Drusus sits Virginia, a wreathe of flowers on her head, looking shocked as she stares at her brother."
    "Mientras tanto, justo enfrente de mí, Virginia está sentada delante de la estatua de Drusus, con una corona de flores en la cabeza, mirando sorprendida a su hermano."

# game/a3s2.rpy:319
translate spanish a3s2_85a2f236:

    # a "\"I challenge you Cato! I challenge you to a trial by combat for the throne, as is my birthright!\""
    a "\"¡Te desafío, Cato! ¡Te desafío a un juicio por combate por el trono, como me corresponde por nacimiento!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:321
translate spanish a3s2_3ec7db84:

    # "It's always hard to judge Cato's facial expressions, but I can see the tightness in his jaw all the way from up here."
    "Siempre es difícil interpretar las expresiones de Cato, pero incluso desde aquí arriba veo lo tensa que tiene la mandíbula."

# game/a3s2.rpy:322
translate spanish a3s2_4765eae1:

    # ca "\"Who...\""
    ca "\"Quién...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:323
translate spanish a3s2_5bc132dd:

    # "Cato glances upward, and for a moment I wonder if somehow he knows I'm there, that he can see me."
    "Cato mira hacia arriba; por un momento me pregunto si de alguna manera sabe que estoy aquí, si puede verme."

# game/a3s2.rpy:324
translate spanish a3s2_bb3b17cf:

    # "But then I notice the camera drones hovering overhead, broadcasting this to all of Adastra."
    "Pero entonces veo los drones con cámaras suspendidos sobre nosotros, transmitiéndolo todo a Adastra."

# game/a3s2.rpy:325
translate spanish a3s2_6501c758:

    # "The entire empire is seeing this."
    "Todo el imperio está viendo esto."

# game/a3s2.rpy:327
translate spanish a3s2_b4cc2d78:

    # ca "\"Why...don't we wait until this is finished, Amicus?\""
    ca "\"Por qué...¿no esperamos a terminar esto, Amicus?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:329
translate spanish a3s2_11419bd2:

    # a "\"It would be wise to stay your paw, Cato...unless you're afraid you'll lose the trial?\""
    a "\"Sería prudente detener tu mano, Cato...¿a menos que temas perder el juicio?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:331
translate spanish a3s2_697df0a1:

    # "The corner of Cato's scarred eye twitches."
    "La esquina del ojo de Cato marcado por la cicatriz se contrae."

# game/a3s2.rpy:332
translate spanish a3s2_43f9279d:

    # "I can tell then that Amicus is playing this all up to the cameras, and that seems to settle it for Cato."
    "Comprendo que Amicus está actuando para las cámaras, y eso parece decidir a Cato."

# game/a3s2.rpy:333
translate spanish a3s2_dcf80945:

    # "With a grunt, he pulls Neferu up to his feet by his head fur, making the jackal wince before shoving him toward the front seat where Neferu slumps down."
    "Con un gruñido, lo levanta del pelo de la cabeza, haciendo que el chacal se estremezca de dolor, y lo empuja hacia el primer asiento, donde Neferu se desploma."

# game/a3s2.rpy:334
translate spanish a3s2_d61475ee:

    # "Then, the old wolf walks past Amicus, setting the dagger down on the long, curved bench as well, across the aisle from Neferu."
    "Después el viejo lobo pasa junto a Amicus y también deja el puñal en el largo banco curvo, al otro lado del pasillo frente a Neferu."

# game/a3s2.rpy:336
translate spanish a3s2_e1867179:

    # ca "\"You know what, Amicus? I think you're right. This is something we should do immediately. We don't want to leave the empire in limbo for any longer, do we?\""
    ca "\"¿Sabes qué, Amicus? Creo que tienes razón. Debemos hacerlo de inmediato. No queremos dejar al imperio en la incertidumbre más tiempo, ¿verdad?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:337
translate spanish a3s2_18d19803:

    # "Amicus watches the other wolf wearily as he walks around him to stand in the center of the amphitheater."
    "Amicus observa con cautela al otro lobo mientras este lo rodea para situarse en el centro del anfiteatro."

# game/a3s2.rpy:338
translate spanish a3s2_eb99deb2:

    # ca "\"It's best to settle...everything, as soon as possible.\""
    ca "\"Es mejor resolver...todo cuanto antes.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:339
translate spanish a3s2_31e06a92:

    # "I know that Cato is referring to all of us...Cassius, Virginia, Neferu, me...and I'm sure Amicus does too, because he glances back up at me for just a moment."
    "Sé que Cato se refiere a todos nosotros...Cassius, Virginia, Neferu, yo...y estoy seguro de que Amicus también lo sabe, porque vuelve a mirarme un instante."

# game/a3s2.rpy:341
translate spanish a3s2_b635ede9:

    # a "\"Then let us settle it!\""
    a "\"¡Entonces resolvámoslo!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:342
translate spanish a3s2_48429b80:

    # "Slowly, I start to make my way down the steps, glancing over at Virginia to see that she's sitting up completely straight, staring at Cato and Amicus, her paws clenched in her lap."
    "Empiezo a bajar lentamente los escalones, mirando a Virginia: está completamente erguida, mirando a Cato y a Amicus, con las manos apretadas en el regazo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:343
translate spanish a3s2_e9bd6bb4:

    # "I move toward Neferu who's sitting on the front bench, hunched over a bit, and I can see metal glinting where his arms are held back."
    "Me acerco a Neferu, sentado algo encorvado en el banco delantero, y veo brillar metal donde tiene los brazos retenidos."

# game/a3s2.rpy:344
translate spanish a3s2_af26870c:

    # ca "\"Alright then, trial by combat, simple {i}pugnu{/i} with no weapons...just teeth and claws.\""
    ca "\"Bien, pues: juicio por combate, un simple {i}pugnu{/i} sin armas...solo dientes y garras.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:345
translate spanish a3s2_1c62e3cc:

    # "Cato stretches."
    "Cato se estira."

# game/a3s2.rpy:346
translate spanish a3s2_e9492ad2:

    # ca "\"I'll give you the advantage of sight, Amicus. This should be no trouble for you at all, eh?\""
    ca "\"Te daré la ventaja de la vista, Amicus. Esto no debería ser ningún problema para ti, ¿eh?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:347
translate spanish a3s2_6f4cb6a4:

    # "Even though that's true, Cato still seems very, very confident."
    "Aunque es cierto, Cato sigue pareciendo muy, muy seguro de sí mismo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:348
translate spanish a3s2_766c7e83:

    # "And he has every right to be considering his skill at fighting along with the fact that Amicus has been locked up for several days in a cramped cell."
    "Y tiene motivos: es un luchador muy hábil y Amicus lleva varios días encerrado en una celda estrecha."

# game/a3s2.rpy:349
translate spanish a3s2_220ad70f:

    # "He probably only said that to increase the humiliation if Amicus loses...if he dies."
    "Seguramente solo lo dijo para aumentar la humillación si Amicus pierde...si muere."

# game/a3s2.rpy:350
translate spanish a3s2_2668d144:

    # "It's then that I start to feel the dread and terror begin to poke through the numbed shock I've been feeling."
    "Entonces empiezo a sentir cómo el pavor y el terror atraviesan el aturdimiento insensible en el que estaba."

# game/a3s2.rpy:351
translate spanish a3s2_2607f720:

    # "But somehow, Amicus looks completely calm, and I take some sort of comfort in that."
    "Pero Amicus parece completamente tranquilo, y eso me da cierto consuelo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:355
translate spanish a3s2_ff578a12:

    # "Quietly, I sit down next to Neferu and he glances over at me."
    "Me siento en silencio junto a Neferu, que me mira."

# game/a3s2.rpy:357
translate spanish a3s2_c3bb8be6:

    # n "\"Oh, [mc], what brings you here?\""
    n "\"Oh, [mc], ¿qué te trae por aquí?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:358
translate spanish a3s2_8e7c88c7:

    # "Though his words are casual, his usual smug demeanor is gone, practically blanked out as he sits there, slightly hunched."
    "Aunque sus palabras son despreocupadas, su habitual aire presumido ha desaparecido; parece casi vacío, sentado allí algo encorvado."

# game/a3s2.rpy:359
translate spanish a3s2_994f6c7b:

    # m "\"Are you okay?\""
    m "\"¿Estás bien?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:360
translate spanish a3s2_b3cc2f27:

    # "I whisper to him, and Neferu takes that as his cue to do so as well."
    "Le susurro, y Neferu entiende que él también debe hacerlo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:361
translate spanish a3s2_b72e71fd:

    # "The jackal shrugs his shoulders."
    "El chacal se encoge de hombros."

# game/a3s2.rpy:362
translate spanish a3s2_44ac0bea:

    # n "\"Not exactly, no, but I'm alive for the time being, so I suppose I can't ask for much more.\""
    n "\"No exactamente, no; pero de momento estoy vivo, así que supongo que no puedo pedir mucho más.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:364
translate spanish a3s2_e7b37b32:

    # "I look back into the amphitheater, wishing that I were able to do something more."
    "Vuelvo a mirar al anfiteatro, deseando poder hacer algo más."

# game/a3s2.rpy:365
translate spanish a3s2_79be8d1f:

    # "I try to catch Amicus's eye, but he keeps his focus on Cato, his own eyes narrowed."
    "Intento captar la mirada de Amicus, pero él se mantiene centrado en Cato, con los ojos entrecerrados."

# game/a3s2.rpy:366
translate spanish a3s2_ccbbe45b:

    # "He looks confident, prepared, ready for whatever it is that Cato throws at him."
    "Parece confiado, preparado, listo para cualquier cosa que Cato le lance."

# game/a3s2.rpy:367
translate spanish a3s2_2bf35716:

    # "But I'm not ready."
    "Pero yo no estoy preparado."

# game/a3s2.rpy:368
translate spanish a3s2_2072d506:

    # "I'm not ready at all."
    "No estoy preparado en absoluto."

# game/a3s2.rpy:369
translate spanish a3s2_458031dd:

    # "That brief interaction in the dungeon, those few seconds of holding on to one another."
    "Aquel breve encuentro en el calabozo, aquellos pocos segundos abrazándonos."

# game/a3s2.rpy:370
translate spanish a3s2_16a4bcc7:

    # "That could be the last time we ever—"
    "Podría haber sido la última vez que—"

# game/a3s2.rpy:371
translate spanish a3s2_462cf016:

    # "I blink back tears again, knowing that won't do me any good right now."
    "Vuelvo a contener las lágrimas, sabiendo que ahora no me ayudarán."

# game/a3s2.rpy:372
translate spanish a3s2_a79d5dfb:

    # ca "\"Are you ready, Amicus?\""
    ca "\"¿Estás listo, Amicus?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:373
translate spanish a3s2_bcc81977:

    # a "\"Yes.\""
    a "\"Sí.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:374
translate spanish a3s2_10f035b1:

    # ca "\"Then let us begin.\""
    ca "\"Entonces empecemos.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:377
translate spanish a3s2_b677edf9:

    # "Immediately, the two wolves begin to circle each other, paws raised up to their chests, open and ready."
    "Los dos lobos empiezan enseguida a girar uno alrededor del otro, con las manos levantadas hasta el pecho, abiertas y listas."

# game/a3s2.rpy:378
translate spanish a3s2_a06a9c3e:

    # "The only difference from past {i}pugnu{/i} fights I've seen is that they're both baring their teeth."
    "La única diferencia con otros combates de {i}pugnu{/i} que he visto es que ambos enseñan los dientes."

# game/a3s2.rpy:379
translate spanish a3s2_d95af87d:

    # "Amicus does it in a way that I've never seen before, not even when he was furious."
    "Amicus lo hace de una forma que nunca le había visto, ni siquiera cuando estaba furioso."

# game/a3s2.rpy:380
translate spanish a3s2_26fac2e9:

    # "It's vicious, feral, like I've seen wolves do in nature documentaries."
    "Es feroz, salvaje, como he visto hacer a los lobos en documentales de naturaleza."

# game/a3s2.rpy:381
translate spanish a3s2_b2598706:

    # "Then, they clash."
    "Entonces chocan."

# game/a3s2.rpy:382
translate spanish a3s2_5a68a795:

    # "It's so fast that I'm not able to tell who moved first, but one moment they're several feet apart and the next, their paws are clasped together while their jaws snap in the air, both going for the other's throat."
    "Es tan rápido que no sé quién se movió primero: un momento están a varios metros y al siguiente se agarran las manos mientras las mandíbulas muerden el aire, ambos buscando la garganta del otro."

# game/a3s2.rpy:383
translate spanish a3s2_571b7a09:

    # "Glistening strands of saliva go flying as they both bite and block with their teeth, ears pinned back, making hoarse, angry barking and growling sounds."
    "Salen volando hilos brillantes de saliva mientras los dos muerden y bloquean con los dientes, con las orejas hacia atrás, emitiendo ladridos y gruñidos roncos e iracundos."

# game/a3s2.rpy:384
translate spanish a3s2_a4a07c26:

    # "It's something I've never seen an Adastran wolf do, not even in their fake dramas."
    "Nunca había visto hacerlo a un lobo de Adastra, ni siquiera en sus dramas ficticios."

# game/a3s2.rpy:385
translate spanish a3s2_8240bdf7:

    # "This feels raw and instinctual, like it's a part of them, something they try to conceal, only to come up to the surface when they're trying to kill."
    "Se siente crudo e instintivo, como una parte de ellos que intentan ocultar y solo emerge cuando tratan de matar."

# game/a3s2.rpy:386
translate spanish a3s2_0cbef590:

    # "I find myself hugging my chest, feeling as if my heart might explode as I watch Amicus, trying to see if he's hurt, wincing every time I hear the solid {i}thwock{/i} of teeth on teeth."
    "Me descubro abrazándome el pecho, sintiendo que el corazón podría estallarme mientras observo a Amicus e intento ver si está herido, estremeciéndome cada vez que oigo el sólido {i}chasquido{/i} de los dientes al chocar."

# game/a3s2.rpy:387
translate spanish a3s2_a8be5033:

    # "It might only have lasted a few seconds, I can't tell, but finally Amicus pulls back and Cato suddenly lunges in for the other wolf's neck."
    "Quizá solo duró unos segundos, no lo sé, pero finalmente Amicus se retira y Cato se lanza de pronto al cuello del otro lobo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:388
translate spanish a3s2_e611fe33:

    # "Time seems to slow, and for a moment I start to think about what I'm going to do if I lose him..."
    "El tiempo parece ralentizarse y, por un instante, empiezo a pensar qué haré si lo pierdo..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:389
translate spanish a3s2_943bea2f:

    # "...but then Cato's open, fang-filled maw drops down and so does the rest of him as Amicus sweeps his legs with a powerful kick."
    "...pero entonces la boca abierta de Cato, llena de colmillos, cae hacia abajo, y el resto de él también, cuando Amicus le barre las piernas con una patada potente."

# game/a3s2.rpy:390
translate spanish a3s2_7f9e8a8c:

    # "Cato goes down hard on his side right in front of me, wheezing before Amicus jumps on him, landing on the older wolf with his knees and a fist to the face."
    "Cato cae de lado con fuerza justo delante de mí, jadeando, antes de que Amicus salte encima y aterrice con las rodillas sobre él y un puño en su cara."

# game/a3s2.rpy:391
translate spanish a3s2_ccd25cc4:

    # "Cato doesn't even seem to notice that though as he immediately grabs on to Amicus, their paws scrabbling at each other as they both try to find a hold."
    "Pero Cato ni parece notarlo: enseguida agarra a Amicus y sus manos forcejean mientras ambos buscan dónde sujetarse."

# game/a3s2.rpy:392
translate spanish a3s2_2b487741:

    # "They're at a stalemate for a while, each one failing to find a good grip as they both twist and turn over each other, making snarling sounds all the while."
    "Permanecen un rato bloqueados, sin conseguir un buen agarre mientras se retuercen y ruedan uno sobre otro, gruñendo sin parar."

# game/a3s2.rpy:393
translate spanish a3s2_aa569c7d:

    # "At some points, I have trouble discerning the two, their legs and arms seeming to blend together as they grip around the other's body."
    "A veces me cuesta distinguirlos; sus brazos y piernas parecen mezclarse al sujetar el cuerpo del otro."

# game/a3s2.rpy:394
translate spanish a3s2_51a9f722:

    # "I was never told much about combat to the death, even when I asked Neferu."
    "Nunca me contaron mucho de los combates a muerte, ni siquiera cuando pregunté a Neferu."

# game/a3s2.rpy:395
translate spanish a3s2_d27a3e32:

    # "All I know is that they tend to be very short, but it's already felt like an eternity."
    "Solo sé que suelen ser muy cortos, pero esto ya se siente eterno."

# game/a3s2.rpy:396
translate spanish a3s2_201ec85f:

    # "Suddenly, I am able to tell them apart as Cato locks Amicus's right arm into a shoulder lock."
    "De pronto puedo distinguirlos cuando Cato inmoviliza el brazo derecho de Amicus con una llave de hombro."

# game/a3s2.rpy:397
translate spanish a3s2_8ca9c282:

    # "While I've seen it done before, usually to get the other opponent to tap out, Cato immediately goes all the way and the quiet of the early evening is shattered with a massive pop and crunching sound."
    "Aunque lo he visto antes, normalmente para hacer que el rival se rinda, Cato lleva la llave hasta el extremo de inmediato y un enorme chasquido y crujido rompe el silencio del anochecer."

# game/a3s2.rpy:398
translate spanish a3s2_87c0b1e1:

    # "Amicus screams, and I find myself standing without even realizing it."
    "Amicus grita y me descubro de pie sin haberlo notado."

# game/a3s2.rpy:399
translate spanish a3s2_3747949f:

    # "It takes everything I have not to jump in right now, even as Cato leans into the hold, causing Amicus to convulse from the pain."
    "Necesito todas mis fuerzas para no intervenir ahora mismo, incluso mientras Cato aprieta la llave y hace que Amicus se convulsione de dolor."

# game/a3s2.rpy:400
translate spanish a3s2_0aba1df0:

    # "Then Cato lets go and my wolf curls over onto his side, shaking violently, loosely holding his arm with his other paw."
    "Después Cato lo suelta y mi lobo se encoge de lado, temblando violentamente y sujetándose flojamente el brazo con la otra mano."

# game/a3s2.rpy:401
translate spanish a3s2_fb6b3f6e:

    # "I want to go to him, but Cato is already there, pushing the younger wolf over onto his back."
    "Quiero ir hacia él, pero Cato ya está allí, empujando al lobo joven para ponerlo boca arriba."

# game/a3s2.rpy:402
translate spanish a3s2_162f4b5a:

    # ca "\"I should have done this a long time ago, pup.\""
    ca "\"Debí hacerlo hace mucho, cachorro.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:403
translate spanish a3s2_1e64d384:

    # "I knew this would happen."
    "Sabía que pasaría esto."

# game/a3s2.rpy:404
translate spanish a3s2_73f69bbf:

    # "Amicus tries to fight back with his good arm, even his legs, trying to lock his ankles around Cato's neck, but the old wolf straddles Amicus's waist before slamming a fist hard into his nose."
    "Amicus intenta defenderse con el brazo sano e incluso con las piernas, tratando de rodear el cuello de Cato con los tobillos, pero el viejo lobo se sienta a horcajadas sobre su cintura y le da un fuerte puñetazo en la nariz."

# game/a3s2.rpy:405
translate spanish a3s2_4379cbfa:

    # "There's a softer crunching sound this time, and Amicus immediately goes limp, eyes vacant, paw falling to his side."
    "Esta vez el crujido es más suave y Amicus queda flácido enseguida, con los ojos vacíos y una mano cayendo a su lado."

# game/a3s2.rpy:406
translate spanish a3s2_386e9586:

    # "I knew Cato was too skilled for Amicus, but for some reason I thought..."
    "Sabía que Cato era demasiado hábil para Amicus, pero por algún motivo pensé..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:408
translate spanish a3s2_be4f3ca5:

    # mon "\"{i}These are the events that shall happen. You are on the right path.{/i}\""
    mon "\"{i}Estos son los acontecimientos que sucederán. Estás en el camino correcto.{/i}\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:409
translate spanish a3s2_3bf0a337:

    # "But am I?"
    "¿Pero lo estoy?"

# game/a3s2.rpy:410
translate spanish a3s2_d168a122:

    # n "\"[mc].\""
    n "\"[mc].\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:411
translate spanish a3s2_2527d43f:

    # "Neferu whispers hurriedly at me."
    "Neferu me susurra apresuradamente."

# game/a3s2.rpy:412
translate spanish a3s2_39a85e0f:

    # "Cato hits Amicus again, even though the other wolf has stopped moving, and Amicus jerks under the weight of the slightly larger wolf."
    "Cato vuelve a golpear a Amicus, aunque ya no se mueve, y mi lobo se sacude bajo el peso del otro, algo más grande."

# game/a3s2.rpy:413
translate spanish a3s2_a7210550:

    # n "\"[mc], you must run, Cato likely does not know you're here.\""
    n "\"[mc], debes correr; probablemente Cato no sabe que estás aquí.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:414
translate spanish a3s2_3a89db1d:

    # "Amicus's eyes are half-closed, unaware for his last moments as Cato pushes his rear down the other wolf's thighs, giving himself room to reach Amicus's neck."
    "Amicus tiene los ojos medio cerrados, inconsciente en sus últimos momentos, mientras Cato desliza el trasero por sus muslos para poder alcanzar su cuello."

# game/a3s2.rpy:415
translate spanish a3s2_decea15d:

    # n "\"Run to the city, to the woods...anywhere...\""
    n "\"Corre a la ciudad, al bosque...a cualquier lugar...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:416
translate spanish a3s2_f5d83df7:

    # "I shake my head silently."
    "Niego con la cabeza en silencio."

# game/a3s2.rpy:417
translate spanish a3s2_75b4c966:

    # "Was this really meant to happen?"
    "¿De verdad estaba destinado a suceder esto?"

# game/a3s2.rpy:418
translate spanish a3s2_7017bfb2:

    # "Why was I put on this path if it ended in my wolf's death?"
    "¿Por qué me pusieron en este camino si acababa con la muerte de mi lobo?"

# game/a3s2.rpy:419
translate spanish a3s2_e2ec28a0:

    # "Why aren't the parents helping me?"
    "¿Por qué no me ayudan los Padres?"

# game/a3s2.rpy:423
translate spanish a3s2_26b87b59:

    # "At that moment, the light of the setting sun catches something shiny to my left."
    "En ese momento la luz del atardecer ilumina algo brillante a mi izquierda."

# game/a3s2.rpy:424
translate spanish a3s2_c95560fb:

    # "I look over, and I'm almost blinded by the brilliant reflection of Vita's light on the blade of the dagger."
    "Miro y casi me ciega el reflejo deslumbrante de la luz de Vita en la hoja del puñal."

# game/a3s2.rpy:425
translate spanish a3s2_7cdca88a:

    # "The one that Cato had set aside after almost executing Neferu."
    "El que Cato dejó después de estar a punto de ejecutar a Neferu."

# game/a3s2.rpy:426
translate spanish a3s2_2041fe9d:

    # "Red and blue jewels decorate the handle while the gold blade shines brighter than any metal I've seen before."
    "Gemas rojas y azules decoran el mango, mientras la hoja dorada brilla más que cualquier metal que haya visto."

# game/a3s2.rpy:427
translate spanish a3s2_137a1540:

    # "{i}The rules don't matter.{/i}"
    "{i}Las reglas no importan.{/i}"

# game/a3s2.rpy:428
translate spanish a3s2_8ff43bf5:

    # "Robotically, I lean over the aisle and grab the dagger by the handle."
    "Mecánicamente, me inclino sobre el pasillo y agarro el puñal por el mango."

# game/a3s2.rpy:429
translate spanish a3s2_a3f1000c:

    # n "\"[mc]?\""
    n "\"¿[mc]?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:430
translate spanish a3s2_8b29a37c:

    # "I ignore Neferu, and at the same time I see Virginia directly across from me."
    "Ignoro a Neferu y, al mismo tiempo, veo a Virginia justo enfrente."

# game/a3s2.rpy:431
translate spanish a3s2_2188d4a4:

    # "Her eyes are wide, and she's standing too, but instead of looking at the fight, at Cato's jaws coming closer and closer to Amicus's neck, she's instead looking at me and pointing."
    "Tiene los ojos muy abiertos y también está de pie, pero en vez de mirar la pelea, las mandíbulas de Cato acercándose al cuello de Amicus, me mira a mí y señala."

# game/a3s2.rpy:432
translate spanish a3s2_4fc3355c:

    # "She's pointing right at Cato, silently encouraging me to do what I'm about to do."
    "Señala directamente a Cato, animándome en silencio a hacer lo que estoy a punto de hacer."

# game/a3s2.rpy:433
translate spanish a3s2_c3a8caa5:

    # "But I don't need encouragement."
    "Pero no necesito que me animen."

# game/a3s2.rpy:434
translate spanish a3s2_f6b0ad8c:

    # "The rules don't matter."
    "Las reglas no importan."

# game/a3s2.rpy:435
translate spanish a3s2_517d3aef:

    # "I jump from my seat, the distance so little that I come down practically on top of the wolves."
    "Salto del asiento; la distancia es tan pequeña que caigo prácticamente encima de los lobos."

# game/a3s2.rpy:436
translate spanish a3s2_74a0db13:

    # "At the same time, I raise the dagger in both hands over my head and bring it down as hard as I can into Cato's back."
    "A la vez alzo el puñal con ambas manos sobre la cabeza y lo hundo con toda mi fuerza en la espalda de Cato."

# game/a3s2.rpy:438
translate spanish a3s2_5d5c1ff4:

    # "As if in slow-motion, I feel the blade slide into my target, very easily at first, like cutting through butter..."
    "Como a cámara lenta, siento entrar la hoja en mi objetivo, al principio muy fácilmente, como cortando mantequilla..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:439
translate spanish a3s2_42f45f55:

    # "...then suddenly I feel something hard, and there's an odd, muffled, stuttered sound of friction as the blade slows considerably."
    "...pero entonces noto algo duro y un extraño sonido apagado e intermitente de fricción cuando la hoja se frena mucho."

# game/a3s2.rpy:440
translate spanish a3s2_8485654c:

    # "It continues to sink in though, in sudden bursts of a few inches at a time, and it's only when the hilt reaches Cato's fur that I realize that I've cut deep into bone...a rib maybe."
    "Aun así sigue hundiéndose a pequeños impulsos de unos centímetros; solo cuando el mango toca el pelo de Cato comprendo que he penetrado profundamente en hueso...quizá una costilla."

# game/a3s2.rpy:441
translate spanish a3s2_50748af5:

    # "Cato howls, suddenly arching back, and I can only hope I was fast enough that he wasn't able to sink his teeth into Amicus's neck."
    "Cato aúlla y arquea de pronto la espalda; solo espero haber sido lo bastante rápido para impedir que clavara los dientes en el cuello de Amicus."

# game/a3s2.rpy:442
translate spanish a3s2_97d2ff23:

    # "I'm not finished though, and I tug once, then twice, before I'm finally able to wrench the blade out of the bone."
    "Pero no he terminado: tiro una vez y después otra antes de conseguir arrancar la hoja del hueso."

# game/a3s2.rpy:443
translate spanish a3s2_bd5ee4c1:

    # "For that split second, Cato begins reaching back awkwardly, unable to find my weapon before I've drawn it back again, above my head before bringing it down as hard as I can into the right side of Cato's neck, just at the base."
    "Durante esa fracción de segundo Cato empieza a extender torpemente una mano hacia atrás, sin encontrar mi arma antes de que vuelva a alzarla sobre la cabeza y la hunda con toda mi fuerza en el lado derecho de su cuello, justo en la base."

# game/a3s2.rpy:445
translate spanish a3s2_e7b708ec:

    # "This time, the blade sinks in easily, once again all the way to the hilt."
    "Esta vez la hoja entra fácilmente, de nuevo hasta el mango."

# game/a3s2.rpy:446
translate spanish a3s2_0237c3fb:

    # "I yank it back once more, intent on plunging it in again, but finally, Cato turns on me, blindly swinging his paw out."
    "La saco otra vez, decidido a clavarla de nuevo, pero finalmente Cato se vuelve hacia mí y lanza una mano a ciegas."

# game/a3s2.rpy:447
translate spanish a3s2_35462404:

    # "His fingers find my right forearm as I'm raising the blade once again, and he takes a tight hold."
    "Sus dedos encuentran mi antebrazo derecho cuando vuelvo a levantar la hoja y lo sujetan con fuerza."

# game/a3s2.rpy:448
translate spanish a3s2_fa4529f0:

    # ca "\"[mc]!\""
    ca "\"¡[mc]!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:449
translate spanish a3s2_ea22df9a:

    # "His exclamation is part astonishment, part fury."
    "Su exclamación es mitad asombro, mitad furia."

# game/a3s2.rpy:450
translate spanish a3s2_220c10ba:

    # "His other paw finds the dagger, and even though I try to hold on to it, he slides it out of my hands with ease, even though he's holding on to the blade end."
    "Su otra mano encuentra el puñal; aunque intento retenerlo, me lo quita fácilmente, incluso sujetándolo por la hoja."

# game/a3s2.rpy:451
translate spanish a3s2_598b2f65:

    # "Blood is everywhere at this point, and I can only hope it's only Cato's."
    "Ya hay sangre por todas partes y solo espero que sea únicamente de Cato."

# game/a3s2.rpy:452
translate spanish a3s2_88228076:

    # "I start to back away, trying to look down at Amicus to see what's happened to him, but that's when Cato swings at me again."
    "Empiezo a retroceder, intentando mirar a Amicus para ver qué le ha pasado, pero entonces Cato vuelve a atacarme."

# game/a3s2.rpy:455
translate spanish a3s2_2a581496:

    # "I feel air tickle my neck and chin, and for a moment I think I've dodged his swing..."
    "El aire me roza el cuello y la barbilla; por un momento creo haber esquivado el golpe..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:456
translate spanish a3s2_9a4f54d9:

    # "...but then I see that he's holding out the blade, out to his right after having swung it at me."
    "...pero entonces veo que sostiene la hoja extendida hacia su derecha después de blandirla contra mí."

# game/a3s2.rpy:457
translate spanish a3s2_4ecabfa8:

    # "{cps=10}..."
    "{cps=10}..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:458
translate spanish a3s2_41664f19:

    # "Something's wrong."
    "Algo va mal."

# game/a3s2.rpy:459
translate spanish a3s2_67a9abe2:

    # "Something's very wrong."
    "Algo va muy mal."

# game/a3s2.rpy:460
translate spanish a3s2_375f9f8d:

    # "I look down and see a sudden spurt of blood, splattering the stones below me, then another spurt, then another."
    "Miro abajo y veo un chorro repentino de sangre salpicando las piedras bajo mí, después otro y después otro."

# game/a3s2.rpy:461
translate spanish a3s2_174c0bfc:

    # "I step back again and gasp, and when I do, it feels like the air comes in from two places at once, and I cough as something liquid goes down my throat the wrong way."
    "Retrocedo otra vez y jadeo; al hacerlo, parece que el aire entra por dos lugares a la vez, y toso cuando un líquido baja por el conducto equivocado de mi garganta."

# game/a3s2.rpy:462
translate spanish a3s2_6aa93f53:

    # "Again, I gasp, and this time I hear a bubbling sound from my throat, and I finally understand what's happened as I raise my hands to my neck, stumbling then falling."
    "Vuelvo a jadear y esta vez oigo un burbujeo en mi garganta; por fin comprendo qué pasó al llevarme las manos al cuello, tropezando y cayendo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:463
translate spanish a3s2_808c0455:

    # "I expect to slam back against the stone seats, but instead it's against something furry and warm."
    "Espero golpearme de espaldas contra los asientos de piedra, pero caigo sobre algo peludo y cálido."

# game/a3s2.rpy:464
translate spanish a3s2_d81e3902:

    # "I look up and see Neferu sitting over me as he'd moved to catch me with his lap."
    "Alzo la vista y veo a Neferu sentado sobre mí; se ha movido para recogerme en su regazo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:466
translate spanish a3s2_07163f5b:

    # "He's staring at me with a look of horror on his face."
    "Me mira con horror en la cara."

# game/a3s2.rpy:467
translate spanish a3s2_28ca8198:

    # n "\"[mc]...\""
    n "\"[mc]...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:468
translate spanish a3s2_04ee6667:

    # "He looks up."
    "Alza la vista."

# game/a3s2.rpy:469
translate spanish a3s2_64053563:

    # n "\"Amicus...Amicus, wake up and help him!\""
    n "\"Amicus...¡Amicus, despierta y ayúdalo!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:470
translate spanish a3s2_ba854869:

    # "I frown, still worried about Cato, and sure enough, as I look forward, I see the false emperor on one knee, clasping his neck, bleeding just as much as I am."
    "Frunzo el ceño, todavía preocupado por Cato; en efecto, al mirar delante veo al falso emperador apoyado en una rodilla, sujetándose el cuello y sangrando tanto como yo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:472
translate spanish a3s2_18f9c0f9:

    # "His ears are perked forward, toward Neferu's voice, and I see him start to make his way toward us."
    "Tiene las orejas orientadas hacia la voz de Neferu y veo cómo empieza a acercarse a nosotros."

# game/a3s2.rpy:473
translate spanish a3s2_35af806b:

    # ca "\"K—Khemian...\""
    ca "\"Kh-Khemiano...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:474
translate spanish a3s2_1a25fb59:

    # "The wolf's eyes are wild, furious, focused in the direction of Neferu."
    "Los ojos del lobo son salvajes, furiosos, centrados en la dirección de Neferu."

# game/a3s2.rpy:475
translate spanish a3s2_40c99017:

    # "He seems to have already forgotten me, even as he seems to realize that he's dying."
    "Parece haberse olvidado de mí, incluso mientras parece comprender que está muriendo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:476
translate spanish a3s2_56d9ec7b:

    # ca "\"You...you...caused this...\""
    ca "\"Tú...tú...has causado esto...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:477
translate spanish a3s2_401c89c1:

    # "I feel that those words \"you\" and \"this\" carry much more meaning for Cato than I could ever hope to know."
    "Siento que aquellas palabras, \"tú\" y \"esto\", tienen mucho más significado para Cato del que yo podría esperar comprender."

# game/a3s2.rpy:478
translate spanish a3s2_f943d01b:

    # "It's a strange moment as I lay in Neferu's lap, bleeding out."
    "Es un momento extraño, tumbado en el regazo de Neferu y desangrándome."

# game/a3s2.rpy:479
translate spanish a3s2_1173285b:

    # "I suppose I knew Cato blamed the Khemians for most of his problems, for most of the problems in the empire."
    "Supongo que sabía que Cato culpaba a los Khemianos de la mayoría de sus problemas y de los problemas del imperio."

# game/a3s2.rpy:480
translate spanish a3s2_8f16ec1c:

    # "He tried to hide it by pretending to give Amicus a fair shot at the emperorship."
    "Intentó ocultarlo fingiendo dar a Amicus una oportunidad justa de convertirse en emperador."

# game/a3s2.rpy:481
translate spanish a3s2_79d6d22b:

    # "As that slowly unraveled, his intentions became clear, and so did his insanity."
    "Cuando aquello empezó a deshacerse, sus intenciones quedaron claras, y su locura también."

# game/a3s2.rpy:482
translate spanish a3s2_c6333c36:

    # "He intends to kill Neferu to completely kill any chance of an alliance, even if it means the complete destruction of the wolven empire."
    "Pretende matar a Neferu para destruir toda posibilidad de alianza, aunque eso signifique la destrucción absoluta del imperio de los lobos."

# game/a3s2.rpy:483
translate spanish a3s2_b2da5410:

    # "Somehow that's a risk worth taking for Cato."
    "De alguna manera, para Cato ese riesgo merece la pena."

# game/a3s2.rpy:484
translate spanish a3s2_a7c434d4:

    # "The old wolf draws closer, practically crawling now, leaving heavy splatters of blood across the ground."
    "El viejo lobo se acerca, ya casi arrastrándose y dejando grandes salpicaduras de sangre en el suelo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:485
translate spanish a3s2_fe76ff50:

    # "He weakly raises the dagger, and I feel Neferu tense behind me, probably getting ready to roll out of the way, but then something wraps around Cato's neck."
    "Levanta débilmente el puñal y siento tensarse a Neferu detrás de mí, seguramente preparándose para apartarse rodando, pero entonces algo rodea el cuello de Cato."

# game/a3s2.rpy:486
translate spanish a3s2_04877949:

    # "With a gargled choke, Cato is pulled back by Amicus before being body slammed to the ground."
    "Con un ahogo gorgoteante, Amicus tira de Cato hacia atrás y después lo estrella contra el suelo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:487
translate spanish a3s2_3d98d1c2:

    # "Then, Amicus is on the old wolf, muzzle against his neck, tearing it apart."
    "Entonces Amicus está sobre el viejo lobo, con el hocico en su cuello, desgarrándolo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:488
translate spanish a3s2_2823521b:

    # "I stare in shock, then look down, away from the horror of what I'm seeing."
    "Miro atónito y después bajo la vista, apartándome del horror."

# game/a3s2.rpy:489
translate spanish a3s2_44bd8b08:

    # "And that's when I see myself covered in blood...so, so much blood."
    "Entonces me veo cubierto de sangre...tantísima sangre."

# game/a3s2.rpy:490
translate spanish a3s2_a6c04166:

    # "My entire naked torso is painted red, and more of it continues to pour over my chest in waves, though it's less than the initial spurts I'd seen when I was standing up."
    "Todo mi torso desnudo está teñido de rojo y más sangre sigue cayendo en oleadas por el pecho, aunque menos que los chorros iniciales que vi estando de pie."

# game/a3s2.rpy:491
translate spanish a3s2_82c88166:

    # "I raise my hands to my neck, still feeling that strange, cold feeling reaching deep into my throat, like everything's open and exposed to the air."
    "Me llevo las manos al cuello, todavía sintiendo aquella extraña frialdad en lo profundo de la garganta, como si todo estuviera abierto y expuesto al aire."

# game/a3s2.rpy:492
translate spanish a3s2_de161f3c:

    # "I try to talk, to tell Neferu that I need help, but only a raspy, bubbling hiss comes out of my neck."
    "Intento hablar, decirle a Neferu que necesito ayuda, pero solo sale un siseo áspero y burbujeante de mi cuello."

# game/a3s2.rpy:493
translate spanish a3s2_5cb05a7a:

    # "I look up, seeing Neferu looking down at me, his expression again one of disbelief."
    "Alzo la vista y veo a Neferu mirándome desde arriba, de nuevo con incredulidad."

# game/a3s2.rpy:494
translate spanish a3s2_a46f8142:

    # "I suppose it would be pretty shocking to see your friend with his neck open, dying in your lap."
    "Supongo que sería bastante impactante ver a un amigo con el cuello abierto, muriendo en tu regazo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:495
translate spanish a3s2_e82a2965:

    # "Am I dying?"
    "¿Me estoy muriendo?"

# game/a3s2.rpy:496
translate spanish a3s2_970659b9:

    # "I try to cover my neck again, but the gash is so deep...it feels like if I lean too far back my head will just...flop over onto my back."
    "Intento cubrirme otra vez el cuello, pero el corte es tan profundo...siento que, si me inclino demasiado hacia atrás, la cabeza simplemente...caerá sobre mi espalda."

# game/a3s2.rpy:497
translate spanish a3s2_1a0f89b1:

    # "Vaguely, I hear Amicus's snarling sounds, along with Cato's raspy screams, sounding just like me when I was trying to talk."
    "Oigo vagamente los gruñidos de Amicus junto a los gritos roncos de Cato, que suenan igual que yo cuando intentaba hablar."

# game/a3s2.rpy:498
translate spanish a3s2_5a365810:

    # "The edges of my vision start to go blurry and black and Neferu's face starts to fade away..."
    "Los bordes de mi visión empiezan a volverse borrosos y negros, y la cara de Neferu se desvanece..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:500
translate spanish a3s2_16adeb6f:

    # "...then suddenly there's a big shift and I wake back up, this time finding Amicus looking down at me."
    "...entonces hay un gran movimiento y vuelvo a despertar; esta vez encuentro a Amicus mirándome desde arriba."

# game/a3s2.rpy:503
translate spanish a3s2_600c1ab2:

    # "An overwhelming sense of relief comes over me."
    "Me invade un alivio abrumador."

# game/a3s2.rpy:504
translate spanish a3s2_e51d5ef5:

    # "I do get to see my wolf after all."
    "Después de todo, consigo volver a ver a mi lobo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:505
translate spanish a3s2_c34b6425:

    # "I smile up at him, even as he stares at me with a look of complete and utter devastation."
    "Le sonrío desde abajo, incluso mientras él me mira con una expresión absolutamente devastada."

# game/a3s2.rpy:506
translate spanish a3s2_5acd0dc1:

    # a "\"No, no, no, no, no, please! Get Felix...Virginia, tell Alex to get Felix!\""
    a "\"¡No, no, no, no, no, por favor! Busca a Felix...¡Virginia, dile a Alex que busque a Felix!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:507
translate spanish a3s2_ea0f2d93:

    # "His tears start to fall on my face, and I reach up, trying to brush them away like he's done for me a few times."
    "Sus lágrimas empiezan a caer sobre mi cara y alzo una mano para intentar limpiárselas, como él ha hecho por mí varias veces."

# game/a3s2.rpy:508
translate spanish a3s2_0a96062a:

    # "He catches my hand before I can though, pressing it back to my neck."
    "Pero atrapa mi mano antes de que pueda y vuelve a presionarla contra mi cuello."

# game/a3s2.rpy:509
translate spanish a3s2_984df0c6:

    # a "\"You'll be fine! You're going to be fine! It's not bad...It's not bad...\""
    a "\"¡Estarás bien! ¡Vas a estar bien! No es grave...No es grave...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:510
translate spanish a3s2_9b250a2d:

    # "I actually chuckle a little at that because this is {i}very{/i} bad."
    "Incluso río un poco, porque es {i}muy{/i} grave."

# game/a3s2.rpy:511
translate spanish a3s2_1e4e2dc4:

    # "I can tell without even being able to see it."
    "Lo sé sin siquiera poder verlo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:512
translate spanish a3s2_5360e5f4:

    # "I see the edges of my vision blurring again, and my eyes seem to try and roll upward on their own, but Amicus gives me a little shake and that brings me back for a moment."
    "Los bordes de mi visión vuelven a desdibujarse y mis ojos parecen intentar girar hacia arriba solos, pero Amicus me sacude un poco y me devuelve un momento a la realidad."

# game/a3s2.rpy:513
translate spanish a3s2_ffa9c5a0:

    # a "\"Hey! Hey, stay here, okay? You'll stay with me, yeah?\""
    a "\"¡Eh! ¡Eh, quédate aquí, vale! Te quedarás conmigo, ¿sí?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:514
translate spanish a3s2_efadf775:

    # "I nod deliriously, the overwhelming feeling of calm and warmth keeping me happy and full of love, even though I know what's happening, what's about to happen to me."
    "Asiento delirando; la sensación abrumadora de calma y calor me mantiene feliz y lleno de amor, aunque sé lo que pasa y lo que está a punto de pasarme."

# game/a3s2.rpy:515
translate spanish a3s2_042818bf:

    # "\"I'm here.\""
    "\"Estoy aquí.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:516
translate spanish a3s2_f2a2857f:

    # "I try to speak, but I only send more bubbling blood out of my neck."
    "Intento hablar, pero solo expulso más sangre burbujeante por el cuello."

# game/a3s2.rpy:517
translate spanish a3s2_47d59596:

    # a "\"No, no! You don't need to talk. I have you.\""
    a "\"¡No, no! No necesitas hablar. Te tengo.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:518
translate spanish a3s2_510c09e6:

    # "How unfair."
    "Qué injusto."

# game/a3s2.rpy:519
translate spanish a3s2_d3524af6:

    # "My last moments and I can't even tell my wolf that I love him."
    "Mis últimos momentos y ni siquiera puedo decirle a mi lobo que lo amo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:520
translate spanish a3s2_b6940032:

    # "I reach up with my free hand, setting it gently against Amicus's face."
    "Alzo mi mano libre y la apoyo suavemente en la cara de Amicus."

# game/a3s2.rpy:521
translate spanish a3s2_84e9a713:

    # "I caress his cheek softly, knowingly, and though he holds it against his face with his own free paw, he shakes his head at me."
    "Le acaricio la mejilla con suavidad, sabiendo lo que ocurre; aunque la mantiene contra su cara con la mano libre, niega con la cabeza."

# game/a3s2.rpy:522
translate spanish a3s2_443cf07d:

    # a "\"Stop that, you're going to be fine. Felix will heal you, we'll rest in my room, I'll take you to the island...I'll take you to the city...we'll be happy...we'll grow old...together.\""
    a "\"Deja eso, vas a estar bien. Felix te curará, descansaremos en mi habitación, te llevaré a la isla...te llevaré a la ciudad...seremos felices...envejeceremos...juntos.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:523
translate spanish a3s2_8b9ffcdc:

    # "The tears start spilling over again, and I just try to keep the smile on my face, to show Amicus that I'm okay, that I'm happy, that this is all okay."
    "Las lágrimas vuelven a derramarse y solo intento mantener la sonrisa para mostrarle a Amicus que estoy bien, que soy feliz, que todo está bien."

# game/a3s2.rpy:524
translate spanish a3s2_157739ed:

    # "And though his grief is hard to look at, there's nothing I'd rather be seeing at the end; my wolf's face, framed by the pinkish-reds of the sunset."
    "Aunque cuesta mirar su dolor, no preferiría ver ninguna otra cosa al final: la cara de mi lobo, enmarcada por los rojos rosados del atardecer."

# game/a3s2.rpy:525
translate spanish a3s2_b1d214ca:

    # "And then, as my eyes start rolling back again, I can't stop them, no matter how hard Amicus shakes me."
    "Después mis ojos vuelven a girarse hacia atrás y no puedo detenerlos, por mucho que Amicus me sacuda."

# game/a3s2.rpy:528
translate spanish a3s2_92294901:

    # a "\"[mc]! No, please! Don't leave me here! Please, come back to me! You can't leave me to be alone like this!\""
    a "\"¡[mc]! ¡No, por favor! ¡No me dejes aquí! ¡Por favor, vuelve a mí! ¡No puedes dejarme solo así!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:529
translate spanish a3s2_042818bf_1:

    # "\"I'm here.\""
    "\"Estoy aquí.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:530
translate spanish a3s2_7af048ec:

    # a "\"No, no, no...speak to me!\""
    a "\"No, no, no...¡háblame!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:531
translate spanish a3s2_6a68bdeb:

    # "\"I'm staying with you...\""
    "\"Me quedo contigo...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:533
translate spanish a3s2_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:534
translate spanish a3s2_a20cefa7_1:

    # "..."
    "..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:535
translate spanish a3s2_a20cefa7_2:

    # "..."
    "..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:538
translate spanish a3s2_5f021f95:

    # "I drift through the blackness, feeling a sense of peace like I've never known before."
    "Floto en la oscuridad, sintiendo una paz que nunca había conocido."

# game/a3s2.rpy:539
translate spanish a3s2_e28f3bf4:

    # "Even though the space is empty, I feel it crowded with others, so many others...or is it one other?"
    "Aunque el espacio está vacío, lo siento lleno de otros, tantos otros...¿o es un solo otro?"

# game/a3s2.rpy:540
translate spanish a3s2_4635a98b:

    # "I sense so many different minds and thoughts, melded together as one."
    "Siento muchas mentes y pensamientos distintos, fusionados en uno."

# game/a3s2.rpy:541
translate spanish a3s2_6b70b450:

    # "\"Hello...\""
    "\"Hola...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:542
translate spanish a3s2_904736e9:

    # "\"We must apologize for what has happened to you.\""
    "\"Debemos disculparnos por lo que te ha ocurrido.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:543
translate spanish a3s2_13859245:

    # "\"It was not our intention for it to end this way.\""
    "\"No era nuestra intención que acabara así.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:544
translate spanish a3s2_9469c842:

    # "\"While not ideal, you have still moved the work of Meera forward.\""
    "\"Aunque no es lo ideal, has hecho avanzar el trabajo de Meera.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:545
translate spanish a3s2_70ce5554:

    # "\"Though we intended for you to complete it, this can be done at a later stage, by a latter sapient.\""
    "\"Aunque queríamos que lo completaras, podrá hacerse en una etapa posterior, por un Sapiente posterior.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:546
translate spanish a3s2_88620a1b:

    # "\"Thank you, [mc], for doing your part for humankind, for wolves, for the {i}Galaxias{/i} as a whole.\""
    "\"Gracias, [mc], por hacer tu parte por la humanidad, por los lobos y por todo el {i}Galaxias{/i}.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:547
translate spanish a3s2_fb0636cf:

    # "\"Now go, be at peace, be one with the amalgamation of intelligence from whence you came.\""
    "\"Ahora vete, encuentra la paz y sé uno con la amalgama de inteligencia de la que procedes.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:548
translate spanish a3s2_d9642c1e:

    # "\"Thank you...\""
    "\"Gracias...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:549
translate spanish a3s2_11915e83:

    # "I begin to dissolve."
    "Empiezo a disolverme."

# game/a3s2.rpy:550
translate spanish a3s2_e0b75cd9:

    # "I'm nowhere and everywhere."
    "Estoy en ninguna parte y en todas."

# game/a3s2.rpy:551
translate spanish a3s2_2810678a:

    # "I'm never and always."
    "Soy nunca y siempre."

# game/a3s2.rpy:552
translate spanish a3s2_a170129b:

    # "I'm nothing..."
    "No soy nada..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:553
translate spanish a3s2_949df7da:

    # "...and everything."
    "...y lo soy todo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:555
translate spanish a3s2_95f4861d:

    # "{cps=10}...all at once..."
    "{cps=10}...todo a la vez..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:559
translate spanish a3s2_5f021f95_1:

    # "I drift through the blackness, feeling a sense of peace like I've never known before."
    "Floto en la oscuridad, sintiendo una paz que nunca había conocido."

# game/a3s2.rpy:560
translate spanish a3s2_e28f3bf4_1:

    # "Even though the space is empty, I feel it crowded with others, so many others...or is it one other?"
    "Aunque el espacio está vacío, lo siento lleno de otros, tantos otros...¿o es un solo otro?"

# game/a3s2.rpy:561
translate spanish a3s2_4635a98b_1:

    # "I sense so many different minds and thoughts, melded together as one."
    "Siento muchas mentes y pensamientos distintos, fusionados en uno."

# game/a3s2.rpy:562
translate spanish a3s2_6b70b450_1:

    # "\"Hello...\""
    "\"Hola...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:563
translate spanish a3s2_9c942f6b:

    # "\"We apologize for what has happened to you.\""
    "\"Nos disculpamos por lo que te ha ocurrido.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:564
translate spanish a3s2_83c57694:

    # "\"We know that you are confused.\""
    "\"Sabemos que estás confundido.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:565
translate spanish a3s2_f084a14e:

    # "\"We told you that this could be prevented...\""
    "\"Te dijimos que esto podía evitarse...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:566
translate spanish a3s2_1b98a2dc:

    # "\"...and it will be.\""
    "\"...y se evitará.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:567
translate spanish a3s2_48d712de:

    # "\"You will not leave him to be alone.\""
    "\"No lo dejarás solo.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:569
translate spanish a3s2_1ba51063:

    # "\"Be at peace for now, for he will come for you.\""
    "\"Descansa en paz de momento, porque vendrá a buscarte.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:570
translate spanish a3s2_7489b341:

    # "\"Wait for him...\""
    "\"Espéralo...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:571
translate spanish a3s2_a20cefa7_3:

    # "..."
    "..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:575
translate spanish a3s2_dec844b1:

    # com "\"Amicus is the victor. All hail Emperor Amicus.\""
    com "\"Amicus es el vencedor. Que viva el emperador Amicus.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:576
translate spanish a3s2_bcc7a45b:

    # "The words sound hollow in Amicus's ears, and so does the faint roar of the crowds in Adastra City all the way across the lake."
    "Las palabras suenan huecas en los oídos de Amicus, al igual que el débil rugido de la multitud en la ciudad de Adastra, al otro lado del lago."

# game/a3s2.rpy:577
translate spanish a3s2_b27b318d:

    # "The wolf can only stare down at the human in his arms, suddenly realizing how light and fragile he actually is."
    "El lobo solo puede mirar al humano que tiene en brazos, comprendiendo de pronto lo ligero y frágil que es."

# game/a3s2.rpy:578
translate spanish a3s2_eef90f02:

    # "And the blood..."
    "Y la sangre..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:579
translate spanish a3s2_fdb3aef1:

    # "...so much blood that paints the front of his human that just moments ago had been so full of life."
    "...tanta sangre que tiñe la parte delantera de su humano, tan lleno de vida hace unos momentos."

# game/a3s2.rpy:580
translate spanish a3s2_9b031ffb:

    # "A tear drops from the tip of Amicus's nose and onto [mc]'s neck, mixing with the blood that has now stopped flowing from the deep gash."
    "Una lágrima cae de la punta de la nariz de Amicus al cuello de [mc], mezclándose con la sangre que ya ha dejado de fluir de la profunda herida."

# game/a3s2.rpy:581
translate spanish a3s2_5ed51327:

    # "Air no longer bubbles through the red liquid either."
    "El aire tampoco burbujea ya por el líquido rojo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:582
translate spanish a3s2_53f5847f:

    # "A strange, choking sound works its way out of Amicus's lips, one he's never heard himself make before."
    "De los labios de Amicus sale un sonido extraño y ahogado, uno que nunca se había oído hacer."

# game/a3s2.rpy:583
translate spanish a3s2_0d866733:

    # "The overflowing sadness in his heart has seemingly run out to be replaced by something empty, cold..."
    "La tristeza desbordante de su corazón parece haberse agotado y dado paso a algo vacío, frío..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:584
translate spanish a3s2_a369a867:

    # "...like there's nothing there anymore."
    "...como si ya no hubiera nada."

# game/a3s2.rpy:585
translate spanish a3s2_4fabaf8d:

    # "Still, Amicus wills the human to live, to use those special healing abilities he seemed to possess, to breathe again."
    "Aun así, Amicus desea con todas sus fuerzas que el humano viva, que use aquellas facultades de curación especiales que parecía tener, que vuelva a respirar."

# game/a3s2.rpy:586
translate spanish a3s2_d8ac5031:

    # "But even as Virginia moves to find Felix, Amicus knows that nothing can be done for something like this."
    "Pero, incluso mientras Virginia va a buscar a Felix, Amicus sabe que no se puede hacer nada ante algo así."

# game/a3s2.rpy:587
translate spanish a3s2_62c746df:

    # "Cato had very nearly beheaded the human, cutting through everything that was important."
    "Cato casi había decapitado al humano, cortando todo lo importante."

# game/a3s2.rpy:588
translate spanish a3s2_73db9c7f:

    # "Cradling [mc]'s head carefully, Amicus raises the young human up to his chest, hugging him tightly, squeezing his eyes shut and feeling the welling tears pour out over his cheeks, down his chin and to the human's hair."
    "Sosteniendo con cuidado la cabeza de [mc], Amicus levanta al joven humano hasta el pecho y lo abraza con fuerza, cerrando los ojos y sintiendo caer las lágrimas por las mejillas, la barbilla y el pelo del humano."

# game/a3s2.rpy:589
translate spanish a3s2_0a8909d7:

    # "It's quiet, and Amicus opens his eyes to see Neferu still sitting there in front of him, staring in shock."
    "Hay silencio; Amicus abre los ojos y ve a Neferu todavía sentado delante, mirando atónito."

# game/a3s2.rpy:591
translate spanish a3s2_c38601c4:

    # "When the jackal meets his eyes, he quickly dips his head, lowering his ears."
    "Cuando el chacal encuentra su mirada, baja rápidamente la cabeza y las orejas."

# game/a3s2.rpy:593
translate spanish a3s2_7cec4a16:

    # n "\"Amicus, I—I'm so sorry...\""
    n "\"Amicus, y-yo lo siento muchísimo...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:595
translate spanish a3s2_7e5c4066:

    # "The wolf raises his eyes to see a drone just over Neferu's head, hovering as its lens focuses voyeuristically on him, broadcasting his grief to Adastra."
    "El lobo alza la mirada y ve un dron sobre la cabeza de Neferu, flotando con la lente enfocada en él de forma voyeurista, transmitiendo su dolor a Adastra."

# game/a3s2.rpy:596
translate spanish a3s2_3496299c:

    # "But this is nothing like those dramas, the tragedies of romantic death he'd seen play out on the screens so many times before."
    "Pero esto no se parece a aquellos dramas, a las tragedias de muerte romántica que tantas veces había visto en las pantallas."

# game/a3s2.rpy:597
translate spanish a3s2_99a422d1:

    # "There is {i}nothing{/i} romantic about this, as Amicus is sure his audience is finding it to be right now."
    "No hay {i}nada{/i} romántico en esto, aunque Amicus está seguro de que ahora su público lo considera así."

# game/a3s2.rpy:598
translate spanish a3s2_8f5e4e97:

    # "This is real death, and the feeling is familiar."
    "Es una muerte real y la sensación es familiar."

# game/a3s2.rpy:599
translate spanish a3s2_f0dfd5bb:

    # "It's hollow, empty, suffocating, like being pulled down into a bottomless, cold, black ocean."
    "Es hueca, vacía, asfixiante, como ser arrastrado a un océano negro y frío sin fondo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:600
translate spanish a3s2_e908bcfc:

    # "It's like when mother died and Cassius had screamed over her body like a wounded animal."
    "Como cuando murió su madre y Cassius gritó sobre su cuerpo como un animal herido."

# game/a3s2.rpy:601
translate spanish a3s2_682607f1:

    # "It's like when he heard the news father had died and how he'd fallen to his knees, clutching his chest and gasping for air like he'd been shot."
    "Como cuando supo que había muerto su padre y cayó de rodillas, agarrándose el pecho y jadeando como si le hubieran disparado."

# game/a3s2.rpy:602
translate spanish a3s2_10d8ef0b:

    # "But this is worse somehow, and Amicus can't even comprehend it."
    "Pero esto es peor de alguna manera, y Amicus ni siquiera puede comprenderlo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:603
translate spanish a3s2_b261a2c0:

    # "It hits him harder than anything he's felt in his life."
    "Lo golpea con más fuerza que cualquier cosa que haya sentido en su vida."

# game/a3s2.rpy:604
translate spanish a3s2_92606b7f:

    # "Everything is going gray, the color being sucked from his vision, from his life..."
    "Todo se vuelve gris; el color desaparece de su visión, de su vida..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:605
translate spanish a3s2_87c38cfd:

    # "And even though he's not sobbing now, the tears are flowing freely down his cheeks."
    "Aunque ahora no solloza, las lágrimas corren libremente por sus mejillas."

# game/a3s2.rpy:606
translate spanish a3s2_df7dafab:

    # "He isn't sure how he can recover from this at all...he knows he probably never will."
    "No sabe cómo podrá recuperarse de esto...sabe que probablemente nunca lo hará."

# game/a3s2.rpy:607
translate spanish a3s2_14f885aa:

    # "This is his fault."
    "Es culpa suya."

# game/a3s2.rpy:608
translate spanish a3s2_e39910a3:

    # "He'd forced the human here."
    "Había obligado al humano a venir."

# game/a3s2.rpy:609
translate spanish a3s2_b30c8211:

    # "He'd made himself feel better by saying [mc] had a choice in the matter, was free to do as he pleased."
    "Se había hecho sentir mejor diciendo que [mc] pudo elegir, que era libre de hacer lo que quisiera."

# game/a3s2.rpy:610
translate spanish a3s2_ea7255b5:

    # "But that wasn't true at all."
    "Pero no era cierto en absoluto."

# game/a3s2.rpy:611
translate spanish a3s2_0251d64d:

    # "He'd taken the human's life, just as Cato had now."
    "Le había quitado la vida al humano, como ahora Cato."

# game/a3s2.rpy:612
translate spanish a3s2_f6efc8b3:

    # "Amicus realizes then that he's no different from the wolves he'd thought himself to be above."
    "Entonces Amicus comprende que no es distinto de los lobos a los que se creía superior."

# game/a3s2.rpy:613
translate spanish a3s2_c2ee6328:

    # "That he was more enlightened somehow in trying to hold all sapient life as equal."
    "Que de alguna manera era más ilustrado al intentar considerar iguales a todas las formas de vida sapiente."

# game/a3s2.rpy:614
translate spanish a3s2_bb2e57c4:

    # "He's even worse."
    "Es todavía peor."

# game/a3s2.rpy:615
translate spanish a3s2_b7db0654:

    # "And even though it would break his heart never to have met [mc], Amicus only wishes that he'd never brought him here in the first place."
    "Y, aunque le rompería el corazón no haber conocido nunca a [mc], Amicus solo desearía no haberlo traído aquí."

# game/a3s2.rpy:616
translate spanish a3s2_5bbc0aa0:

    # "To his death."
    "A su muerte."

# game/a3s2.rpy:617
translate spanish a3s2_35c1cd7c:

    # "The thought brings another wave of heart-wrenching grief to crash through his hollow chest, and for a moment he almost can't breathe."
    "La idea hace que otra oleada de dolor desgarrador choque contra su pecho vacío, y por un momento casi no puede respirar."

# game/a3s2.rpy:618
translate spanish a3s2_3806b6f8:

    # a "\"Please, [mc]...\""
    a "\"Por favor, [mc]...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:619
translate spanish a3s2_caf88a65:

    # "The young wolf whispers into the human's hair, his voice now only a soft whine as fresh tears blur his vision."
    "El joven lobo susurra contra el pelo del humano; su voz es apenas un suave gemido mientras nuevas lágrimas le nublan la vista."

# game/a3s2.rpy:620
translate spanish a3s2_3ddcdb82:

    # "His teachings since he was a pup begin to come to mind;"
    "Empieza a recordar lo que le enseñaron desde cachorro:"

# game/a3s2.rpy:621
translate spanish a3s2_556430a3:

    # "[mc]'s soul, like the soul of all sapients, is ascending to the Greater Intelligence, mingling with the lives of billions of others; with his father, his mother, maybe Cassius, too."
    "El alma de [mc], como la de todos los Sapientes, asciende a la Inteligencia Mayor, mezclándose con las vidas de miles de millones de otros: su padre, su madre, quizá también Cassius."

# game/a3s2.rpy:622
translate spanish a3s2_d350c40f:

    # "A place he'd also join one day..."
    "Un lugar al que él también llegaría algún día..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:623
translate spanish a3s2_81db397f:

    # "...but..."
    "...pero..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:624
translate spanish a3s2_77959326:

    # "...but the human's soul belonged {i}here{/i}, in his arms, not to be mixed and consumed by the parents, not yet."
    "...pero el alma del humano debía estar {i}aquí{/i}, entre sus brazos, no mezclada y consumida por los Padres; todavía no."

# game/a3s2.rpy:625
translate spanish a3s2_a6cf3261:

    # "That mixed, singular being isn't [mc]."
    "Aquel ser mezclado y único no es [mc]."

# game/a3s2.rpy:626
translate spanish a3s2_b54c9d7e:

    # "It's like a beautiful mural being shattered, then reconstructed into something else."
    "Es como destrozar un mural hermoso y después reconstruirlo en otra cosa."

# game/a3s2.rpy:627
translate spanish a3s2_a5a8219f:

    # "[mc] still exists, at this very moment he exists, but it's no longer {i}him{/i}."
    "[mc] todavía existe, existe ahora mismo, pero ya no es {i}él{/i}."

# game/a3s2.rpy:628
translate spanish a3s2_bab0a133:

    # "Amicus grits his teeth, feeling anger begin to overcome the overwhelming grief."
    "Amicus aprieta los dientes y siente que la ira empieza a superar el dolor abrumador."

# game/a3s2.rpy:629
translate spanish a3s2_7072f3b4:

    # "No..."
    "No..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:630
translate spanish a3s2_a3e12093:

    # "...No..."
    "...No..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:633
translate spanish a3s2_36517e23:

    # a "\"...No.\""
    a "\"... No.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:634
translate spanish a3s2_1361ec34:

    # "How dare they."
    "Cómo se atreven."

# game/a3s2.rpy:635
translate spanish a3s2_aea4e2f8:

    # "This isn't fair."
    "No es justo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:636
translate spanish a3s2_28149d93:

    # "The parents had spoken to [mc], had told him what to do, had lead him to this point."
    "Los Padres habían hablado con [mc], le habían dicho qué hacer, lo habían llevado hasta aquí."

# game/a3s2.rpy:637
translate spanish a3s2_45303ba8:

    # "When the human had told Amicus that he was worried about something terrible happening..."
    "Cuando el humano le contó a Amicus que temía que ocurriera algo terrible..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:638
translate spanish a3s2_1af1d544:

    # "Amicus grits his teeth, remembering how he'd brushed it off, even though he'd told [mc] that he believed him, that he'd have nothing to worry about if he followed their guidance."
    "Amicus aprieta los dientes al recordar cómo lo desestimó, aunque le había dicho a [mc] que lo creía, que no tendría nada que temer si seguía su guía."

# game/a3s2.rpy:639
translate spanish a3s2_6e705687:

    # a "\"No...\""
    a "\"No...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:640
translate spanish a3s2_21859b64:

    # "Amicus shakes his head, still clutching onto the human tightly."
    "Amicus niega con la cabeza, todavía abrazando con fuerza al humano."

# game/a3s2.rpy:642
translate spanish a3s2_1ae13089:

    # n "\"Amicus?\""
    n "\"¿Amicus?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:643
translate spanish a3s2_58bbb85d:

    # "Neferu's voice is tentative, almost fearful, like he's worried about what Amicus might do."
    "La voz de Neferu es vacilante, casi asustada, como si le preocupara lo que Amicus pueda hacer."

# game/a3s2.rpy:644
translate spanish a3s2_515ac90d:

    # "Amicus isn't even sure of that himself as he rises to his feet, cradling the human in his one good arm, easily able to do so because of their difference in size."
    "Ni Amicus lo sabe al ponerse de pie, sosteniendo al humano con su único brazo sano, algo fácil por la diferencia de tamaño."

# game/a3s2.rpy:646
translate spanish a3s2_421cbc0a:

    # "He turns and walks quickly toward the palace, almost jogging, ignoring the various jolts of pain throughout his body."
    "Se vuelve y camina rápido hacia el palacio, casi trotando, ignorando las punzadas de dolor que recorren su cuerpo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:647
translate spanish a3s2_17524ee7:

    # "He doesn't even glance down at Cato's unmoving body as he passes by."
    "Ni siquiera mira al cuerpo inmóvil de Cato al pasar."

# game/a3s2.rpy:648
translate spanish a3s2_273984df:

    # "The wolf's expression is stoic now, a strange rage bubbling just under the surface."
    "La expresión del lobo es ahora impasible, con una extraña rabia bullendo bajo la superficie."

# game/a3s2.rpy:649
translate spanish a3s2_6e9bdbb9:

    # n "\"Amicus!\""
    n "\"¡Amicus!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:650
translate spanish a3s2_84fddfc5:

    # "Neferu calls after him, but Amicus ignores the jackal, set on one thing, and one thing only:"
    "Neferu lo llama, pero Amicus ignora al chacal, centrado en una cosa y solo una:"

# game/a3s2.rpy:651
translate spanish a3s2_38c1572d:

    # "The parents might have taken his parents, maybe even his brother, but they aren't going to take his human."
    "Los Padres pueden haberle quitado a sus padres, quizá incluso a su hermano, pero no le quitarán a su humano."

# game/a3s2.rpy:652
translate spanish a3s2_274c8aa0:

    # "He won't allow it."
    "No lo permitirá."

# game/a3s2.rpy:654
translate spanish a3s2_ecfe05fc:

    # "As the wolf enters the palace, he notices Alex pacing the hallway."
    "Al entrar en el palacio, el lobo ve a Alex caminando de un lado a otro por el pasillo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:655
translate spanish a3s2_d84a91a0:

    # "He stops as he sees the wolf approaching."
    "Se detiene al ver acercarse al lobo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:657
translate spanish a3s2_3d2e07bb:

    # al "\"Amicus! I heard that you're now emperor and...\""
    al "\"¡Amicus! He oído que ahora eres emperador y...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:658
translate spanish a3s2_9dff9815:

    # "He trails off as he sees [mc] cradled in the wolf's arm."
    "Se interrumpe al ver a [mc] sostenido por el brazo del lobo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:660
translate spanish a3s2_7de95e70:

    # "The blood covering the body, flowing down a limply hanging arm to drip gently from the fingertips."
    "La sangre que cubre el cuerpo, fluyendo por un brazo que cuelga inerte hasta gotear suavemente de los dedos."

# game/a3s2.rpy:661
translate spanish a3s2_bac66543:

    # "Amicus brushes past the cat, eyes set straight ahead, expressionless."
    "Amicus pasa junto al gato, con los ojos fijos delante y sin expresión."

# game/a3s2.rpy:663
translate spanish a3s2_f8e190be:

    # "Nothing seems to exist outside of the wolf's tunnel vision."
    "Nada parece existir fuera de la visión estrecha del lobo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:664
translate spanish a3s2_6fc847b3:

    # "Soon, he comes to the door he's looking for and leans forward, pressing his injured shoulder to the panel to open it, ignoring the blaze of pain that shoots through him as he does."
    "Pronto llega a la puerta que busca y se inclina, presionando el hombro herido contra el panel para abrirla, ignorando el dolor abrasador que lo atraviesa."

# game/a3s2.rpy:666
translate spanish a3s2_6125fcbb:

    # "Amicus approaches the archive, glaring at the orb, as if the machinery itself is the parents."
    "Amicus se acerca al archivo y mira con furia la esfera, como si los propios mecanismos fueran los Padres."

# game/a3s2.rpy:667
translate spanish a3s2_018d6a80:

    # "The big wolf comes to a stop in front of it, staring up at the glowing blue structure for a moment before looking down at [mc]."
    "El gran lobo se detiene delante y contempla un momento la estructura azul brillante antes de mirar a [mc]."

# game/a3s2.rpy:668
translate spanish a3s2_675f074f:

    # "The ashen color of the skin is unnerving, so different from the deep tones it once had."
    "El color ceniciento de la piel es inquietante, tan distinto de los tonos intensos que tenía antes."

# game/a3s2.rpy:669
translate spanish a3s2_09ba6310:

    # "[mc] is dead, Amicus knows that, but he won't accept it."
    "[mc] está muerto; Amicus lo sabe, pero no lo acepta."

# game/a3s2.rpy:670
translate spanish a3s2_12e92c8a:

    # "The wolf presses his face close to the human's for a moment, feeling the fading warmth before kissing him gently on the top of his head."
    "El lobo acerca un momento la cara a la del humano, sintiendo el calor que se apaga, y después le besa suavemente la parte superior de la cabeza."

# game/a3s2.rpy:672
translate spanish a3s2_af47a4ad:

    # "With that, Amicus leans forward, pressing them both to the sphere."
    "Entonces Amicus se inclina y los presiona a ambos contra la esfera."

# game/a3s2.rpy:673
translate spanish a3s2_17e80ac7:

    # "Then he connects, and he merges with the universe."
    "Después se conecta y se funde con el universo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:676
translate spanish a3s2_bac0d7c3:

    # "We continue to drift through infinite space, content."
    "Seguimos flotando por el espacio infinito, satisfechos."

# game/a3s2.rpy:678
translate spanish a3s2_f6c0387a:

    # "Despite everything, we trust the beings around us, all of us and the others...the parents."
    "A pesar de todo, confiamos en los seres que nos rodean, en todos nosotros y en los otros...los Padres."

# game/a3s2.rpy:679
translate spanish a3s2_ef2377bb:

    # "The parents."
    "Los Padres."

# game/a3s2.rpy:680
translate spanish a3s2_569ebb7f:

    # "This was all meant to happen."
    "Todo esto estaba destinado a suceder."

# game/a3s2.rpy:681
translate spanish a3s2_24bf0b50:

    # "And though it was hard and terrible..."
    "Y, aunque fue duro y terrible..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:682
translate spanish a3s2_36255a83:

    # "...the worst is now over."
    "...lo peor ya ha pasado."

# game/a3s2.rpy:683
translate spanish a3s2_69406896:

    # "And that thought alone is enough to keep us completely relaxed, waves and waves of relief washing over us."
    "Solo esa idea basta para mantenernos completamente relajados, con oleadas y oleadas de alivio bañándonos."

# game/a3s2.rpy:684
translate spanish a3s2_70863461:

    # "In the cacophony of thoughts and emotions though, something stands out..."
    "Pero algo destaca en la cacofonía de pensamientos y emociones..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:685
translate spanish a3s2_44c80609:

    # "Though the beings meld together, one seems to become separate for a moment, solely to focus directly on us...on...me..."
    "Aunque los seres se funden, uno parece separarse un momento, solo para centrarse directamente en nosotros...en...mí..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:686
translate spanish a3s2_c7e8e7dc:

    # "This brings me out of my trance for a bit, and I turn my attention on them."
    "Eso me saca un poco del trance y dirijo mi atención hacia ese ser."

# game/a3s2.rpy:687
translate spanish a3s2_f95af865:

    # "Amicus?"
    "¿Amicus?"

# game/a3s2.rpy:688
translate spanish a3s2_45d2e564:

    # "But then, as I focus more on this being, I get a different feeling; not {i}him{/i}, but {i}her{/i}."
    "Pero, al concentrarme más en este ser, tengo otra sensación: no {i}él{/i}, sino {i}ella{/i}."

# game/a3s2.rpy:689
translate spanish a3s2_5ea7bd41:

    # "It seems like she wants to speak to me."
    "Parece querer hablar conmigo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:690
translate spanish a3s2_ba5ee64b:

    # "She's not familiar, not someone I've spoken to before..."
    "No me resulta familiar; no es alguien con quien haya hablado antes..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:691
translate spanish a3s2_b0cbebab:

    # "But the intensity with which she is focusing on me..."
    "Pero la intensidad con la que se centra en mí..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:692
translate spanish a3s2_a805804c:

    # "\"Hello?\""
    "\"¿Hola?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:694
translate spanish a3s2_67eae072:

    # "I reach out, but then suddenly the amalgamation of intelligence begins to pull away, and I feel myself extracted from its mass."
    "Extiendo una mano, pero de pronto la amalgama de inteligencia empieza a alejarse y siento que me extraen de su masa."

# game/a3s2.rpy:695
translate spanish a3s2_7eaf560a:

    # "The feeling is bizarre and I almost miss the crowding of thoughts and feelings, of being one with many."
    "La sensación es extraña y casi echo de menos la multitud de pensamientos y emociones, ser uno con muchos."

# game/a3s2.rpy:696
translate spanish a3s2_74df6fb5:

    # "But then I feel myself again...my body...beginning to materialize out of nothing."
    "Pero entonces vuelvo a sentirme a mí mismo...mi cuerpo...empezando a materializarse de la nada."

# game/a3s2.rpy:697
translate spanish a3s2_4cfe8eb2:

    # "The nothingness around me slowly becomes something..."
    "La nada que me rodea se convierte lentamente en algo..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:699
translate spanish a3s2_333bd19b:

    # "For a moment, I'm floating in the air...then I'm being held by something strong and solid."
    "Por un momento floto en el aire...después algo fuerte y sólido me sostiene."

# game/a3s2.rpy:701
translate spanish a3s2_5ab617cb:

    # "The first thing I see is Amicus's face."
    "Lo primero que veo es la cara de Amicus."

# game/a3s2.rpy:702
translate spanish a3s2_61498f36:

    # "He's looking down at me, grim and determined."
    "Me mira desde arriba, serio y decidido."

# game/a3s2.rpy:703
translate spanish a3s2_93a42fd0:

    # "Just as I focus on him though, his expression changes."
    "Pero, justo cuando enfoco la vista en él, su expresión cambia."

# game/a3s2.rpy:705
translate spanish a3s2_804cd142_1:

    # a "\"[mc]?\""
    a "\"¿[mc]?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:706
translate spanish a3s2_79ae5c19:

    # "I shift a little, trying to focus better on my wolf."
    "Me muevo un poco, intentando enfocar mejor a mi lobo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:707
translate spanish a3s2_27b7f10b:

    # a "\"[mc]!\""
    a "\"¡[mc]!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:710
translate spanish a3s2_91844457:

    # "Suddenly, I'm surrounded by fur, getting squeezed tight against Amicus, my face pressed into his neck."
    "De pronto estoy rodeado de pelo y apretado contra Amicus, con la cara en su cuello."

# game/a3s2.rpy:711
translate spanish a3s2_654260f4:

    # "Instinctively, I wrap my arms around him."
    "Lo rodeo con los brazos instintivamente."

# game/a3s2.rpy:712
translate spanish a3s2_568c08e4:

    # a "\"Oh gods, are you real? Tell me you're real, [mc]...please...\""
    a "\"Oh, dioses, ¿eres real? Dime que eres real, [mc]...por favor...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:713
translate spanish a3s2_c1e86123:

    # "He gasps the words, like he's coming up for air after diving to the bottom of the lake."
    "Jadea las palabras, como si saliera a respirar tras sumergirse hasta el fondo del lago."

# game/a3s2.rpy:714
translate spanish a3s2_4d257267:

    # "I'm having trouble remembering things, why he seems so upset."
    "Me cuesta recordar las cosas, por qué parece tan alterado."

# game/a3s2.rpy:715
translate spanish a3s2_acd74d35:

    # "But I know something bad happened, and now it's over, so I try to comfort him."
    "Pero sé que pasó algo malo y ahora ha terminado, así que intento consolarlo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:716
translate spanish a3s2_64ad7a9d:

    # m "\"I'm real...I'm here.\""
    m "\"Soy real...estoy aquí.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:717
translate spanish a3s2_5957e9f1:

    # "My voice is strange, like I haven't used it in a while."
    "Mi voz suena extraña, como si llevara un tiempo sin usarla."

# game/a3s2.rpy:718
translate spanish a3s2_e618aeb1:

    # "At first, I think I'm back in Amicus's room after I've woken up from the coma, still trying to convince him that everything is okay."
    "Al principio creo haber vuelto a la habitación de Amicus tras despertar del coma, todavía tratando de convencerlo de que todo está bien."

# game/a3s2.rpy:719
translate spanish a3s2_77f922a3:

    # "Like we'd gone to sleep and just woken up and he wants to be reassured again that I'm not going to disappear."
    "Como si nos hubiéramos dormido y acabado de despertar, y quisiera que le asegurara otra vez que no voy a desaparecer."

# game/a3s2.rpy:720
translate spanish a3s2_1c7cd8b0:

    # "But then I remember that Cato came in that morning..."
    "Pero después recuerdo que Cato entró aquella mañana..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:721
translate spanish a3s2_be629d93:

    # "Things fall into place like a long row of giant, heavy dominoes."
    "Las cosas encajan como una larga fila de enormes y pesadas fichas de dominó."

# game/a3s2.rpy:722
translate spanish a3s2_1754378e:

    # "I suddenly sit up a bit, against Amicus's chest, pushing back so I can look up at him."
    "Me incorporo un poco de pronto contra el pecho de Amicus, empujando hacia atrás para poder mirarlo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:723
translate spanish a3s2_e640a610:

    # m "\"Wait! The fight...Cato...Amicus, are you okay?\""
    m "\"¡Espera! La pelea...Cato...Amicus, ¿estás bien?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:725
translate spanish a3s2_157fc292:

    # "I look him over, trying to check his wounds."
    "Lo examino, intentando comprobar sus heridas."

# game/a3s2.rpy:726
translate spanish a3s2_487ae56a:

    # "The blood and swelling that I'd seen in the amphitheater is gone though."
    "Pero la sangre y la hinchazón que vi en el anfiteatro han desaparecido."

# game/a3s2.rpy:727
translate spanish a3s2_8f9d67b3:

    # "He's clean and well-groomed, and his arm seems fine judging by its sturdiness underneath me."
    "Está limpio y bien aseado; su brazo parece sano, a juzgar por lo firme que lo siento debajo de mí."

# game/a3s2.rpy:728
translate spanish a3s2_3be39ed2:

    # "My brief look at him is ended though as Amicus suddenly yanks me back against his chest, sobbing against me."
    "Mi breve examen acaba cuando Amicus me atrae de golpe contra su pecho, sollozando contra mí."

# game/a3s2.rpy:730
translate spanish a3s2_4a9dfd04:

    # "I've seen Amicus cry before, back in the dungeon, but not these gut-wrenching sobs that I can feel heaving through my own body."
    "He visto llorar a Amicus antes, en los calabozos, pero no con estos sollozos desgarradores que sacuden mi propio cuerpo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:731
translate spanish a3s2_d73f1703:

    # "It serves to shock me to my senses even more."
    "Eso me devuelve aún más a mis sentidos."

# game/a3s2.rpy:732
translate spanish a3s2_8b63af6c:

    # "Firmly, I push back against his chest, creating space between us so I can hold his face in my hands."
    "Lo aparto con firmeza por el pecho, creando espacio para sostenerle la cara entre las manos."

# game/a3s2.rpy:734
translate spanish a3s2_031a1acc:

    # "He just looks back at me, crying openly, and I watch as the tears well out of his eyes and seem to disappear into the fur of his cheeks."
    "Solo me mira, llorando abiertamente; veo las lágrimas brotar de sus ojos y parecer desaparecer entre el pelo de sus mejillas."

# game/a3s2.rpy:735
translate spanish a3s2_cfbcae4e:

    # "I'm sure we both want to say a lot in this moment."
    "Seguro que ambos queremos decir mucho en este momento."

# game/a3s2.rpy:736
translate spanish a3s2_eca8877d:

    # "What happened, what's happening now, what {i}will{/i} happen, but at this particular moment in time and space, we're back together."
    "Lo que pasó, lo que pasa ahora, lo que {i}pasará{/i}; pero en este instante concreto del tiempo y el espacio volvemos a estar juntos."

# game/a3s2.rpy:737
translate spanish a3s2_6e4671f5:

    # "It's impossible, but it's happening, so I cling to him again, and he just holds me as I press my face against his chest, listening to his hammering heart, squeezing my eyes shut."
    "Es imposible, pero está pasando, así que vuelvo a aferrarme a él; me abraza mientras apoyo la cara en su pecho y escucho su corazón martilleante con los ojos cerrados."

# game/a3s2.rpy:739
translate spanish a3s2_20be12f7:

    # "If this is eternity, then I'm completely fine with it."
    "Si esto es la eternidad, estoy completamente de acuerdo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:740
translate spanish a3s2_72d97618:

    # "I'm not sure how much time passes, but as this thought crosses my mind a few times, my eyes suddenly fly open."
    "No sé cuánto tiempo pasa, pero, cuando esta idea cruza varias veces mi mente, abro de pronto los ojos."

# game/a3s2.rpy:741
translate spanish a3s2_abba36ec:

    # "I press back again, looking up at the wolf, holding his face again."
    "Vuelvo a apartarme, mirándolo desde abajo y sosteniéndole otra vez la cara."

# game/a3s2.rpy:742
translate spanish a3s2_481ed029:

    # m "\"Wait...if you're here, did you...\""
    m "\"Espera...si estás aquí, ¿has...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:743
translate spanish a3s2_b34031a9:

    # "I wonder suddenly if maybe Amicus had been seriously wounded in the fight, that he didn't make it after all."
    "De pronto me pregunto si quizá Amicus resultó gravemente herido en la pelea y al final no sobrevivió."

# game/a3s2.rpy:744
translate spanish a3s2_1fb272e3:

    # "But Amicus shakes his head gently, his sobs having quieted to subdued sniffles and hiccups."
    "Pero niega suavemente con la cabeza; sus sollozos se han calmado hasta convertirse en sorbidos discretos y pequeños hipos."

# game/a3s2.rpy:746
translate spanish a3s2_a0e1ceb3:

    # a "\"No...no, I'm fine. I won. Cato is dead.\""
    a "\"No...no, estoy bien. Gané. Cato está muerto.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:747
translate spanish a3s2_219f9a46:

    # "I'm flooded with relief."
    "Me inunda el alivio."

# game/a3s2.rpy:748
translate spanish a3s2_2764bdf1:

    # "He strokes my hair gently, slowly, and I wonder why he still looks so sad."
    "Me acaricia el pelo despacio y con suavidad, y me pregunto por qué sigue tan triste."

# game/a3s2.rpy:749
translate spanish a3s2_3c0d46a6:

    # m "\"But how are you here, aren't I...\""
    m "\"Pero ¿cómo estás aquí? ¿No estoy yo...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:750
translate spanish a3s2_5ee25c38:

    # "I look around at the infinite space surrounding us."
    "Contemplo el espacio infinito que nos rodea."

# game/a3s2.rpy:751
translate spanish a3s2_6aa61197:

    # "The stars and planets are unusually close, stunningly bright, and unimaginably vivid."
    "Las estrellas y planetas están inusualmente cerca, asombrosamente brillantes y de una viveza inimaginable."

# game/a3s2.rpy:752
translate spanish a3s2_839945b1:

    # "The blues, purples, and blacks are deep and monolithic, signaling the endless space that stretches beyond."
    "Los azules, morados y negros son profundos e inmensos, señalando el espacio interminable que se extiende más allá."

# game/a3s2.rpy:753
translate spanish a3s2_77cdbcfe:

    # m "\"Am I dead?\""
    m "\"¿Estoy muerto?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:754
translate spanish a3s2_0404e8ff:

    # "Amicus pulls me back against him, forcing me to look away from the churning universe."
    "Amicus vuelve a atraerme contra él, obligándome a apartar la vista del universo agitado."

# game/a3s2.rpy:756
translate spanish a3s2_8ac0b7d0:

    # a "\"No, you're here.\""
    a "\"No, estás aquí.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:757
translate spanish a3s2_b0ca33ed:

    # "It sounds more like he's convincing himself rather than me."
    "Suena más como si intentara convencerse él que convencerme a mí."

# game/a3s2.rpy:758
translate spanish a3s2_a6dae190:

    # m "\"But where's 'here'?\""
    m "\"Pero ¿dónde es 'aquí'?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:759
translate spanish a3s2_4724e75d:

    # "Amicus is quiet for a moment, and I find myself content to lean against him for a while, just wanting to be close to him."
    "Amicus guarda silencio un momento, y me basta con apoyarme un rato en él; solo quiero estar cerca."

# game/a3s2.rpy:760
translate spanish a3s2_c4f55fca:

    # "At some point Amicus had sat down, and I'm cradled in his lap."
    "En algún momento Amicus se ha sentado y me sostiene en el regazo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:761
translate spanish a3s2_6c104349:

    # "Considering we're not just floating around in zero gravity, I have to assume there's something solid underneath us somehow."
    "Como no estamos flotando sin gravedad, debo suponer que hay algo sólido debajo de nosotros de alguna manera."

# game/a3s2.rpy:762
translate spanish a3s2_17c00067:

    # "Amicus sniffles again."
    "Amicus vuelve a sorber por la nariz."

# game/a3s2.rpy:764
translate spanish a3s2_1fee6156:

    # a "\"I melded my mind with the archive to speak to the parents...that's all I know.\""
    a "\"Fundí mi mente con el archivo para hablar con los Padres...es todo lo que sé.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:765
translate spanish a3s2_a5ed7e8b:

    # "I think."
    "Reflexiono."

# game/a3s2.rpy:766
translate spanish a3s2_1995937a:

    # m "\"Did I do the same, then?\""
    m "\"¿Entonces yo hice lo mismo?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:767
translate spanish a3s2_a3c80254:

    # a "\"I was holding you when I did it...\""
    a "\"Te sostenía cuando lo hice...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:768
translate spanish a3s2_6b2dbe2a:

    # "My neck...the blood..."
    "Mi cuello...la sangre..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:769
translate spanish a3s2_7102fceb:

    # "I look up at him again."
    "Vuelvo a mirarlo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:770
translate spanish a3s2_9a713961:

    # m "\"Amicus...am I alive?\""
    m "\"Amicus...¿estoy vivo?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:771
translate spanish a3s2_d3ed9f29:

    # "Amicus looks at me for a moment before his face screws up and tears well up again."
    "Amicus me mira un instante y después se le contrae la cara y vuelven a brotar las lágrimas."

# game/a3s2.rpy:773
translate spanish a3s2_e4483b49:

    # a "\"I...don't know.\""
    a "\"Yo...no lo sé.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:775
translate spanish a3s2_dde9eafe:

    # "He whines out the words and I immediately hug him again."
    "Dice las palabras en un gemido y lo abrazo enseguida otra vez."

# game/a3s2.rpy:777
translate spanish a3s2_fbdfbfa1:

    # m "\"Hey, I'm okay, see? I'm here.\""
    m "\"Eh, estoy bien, ¿ves? Estoy aquí.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:778
translate spanish a3s2_dd8e3908:

    # "Another sobbing fit starts."
    "Empieza otro ataque de llanto."

# game/a3s2.rpy:779
translate spanish a3s2_4a89a5bb:

    # "And now I know why."
    "Ahora sé por qué."

# game/a3s2.rpy:780
translate spanish a3s2_ee740b8b:

    # "I must have died, and now, for whatever reason, the parents have let us reunite somehow."
    "Debí morir, y ahora, por el motivo que sea, los Padres nos han permitido reunirnos de alguna manera."

# game/a3s2.rpy:781
translate spanish a3s2_b34ba5af:

    # "And I know that Amicus must be wondering the same thing that I am:"
    "Sé que Amicus debe estar preguntándose lo mismo que yo:"

# game/a3s2.rpy:782
translate spanish a3s2_792fe4ad:

    # "How long is this going to last?"
    "¿Cuánto durará esto?"

# game/a3s2.rpy:783
translate spanish a3s2_1fd5d565:

    # "I try to think of what to say, in case this is our last moment together, in case I am going to be...absorbed again."
    "Intento pensar qué decir, por si es nuestro último momento juntos, por si vuelven a...absorberme."

# game/a3s2.rpy:784
translate spanish a3s2_ec98a4a0:

    # "But my mind comes up short in the weirdest of ways, only able to think of things that don't matter."
    "Pero mi mente falla de la forma más extraña, capaz solo de pensar en cosas que no importan."

# game/a3s2.rpy:785
translate spanish a3s2_a26ebb43:

    # "So, I settle on what had just happened."
    "Así que elijo lo que acaba de suceder."

# game/a3s2.rpy:786
translate spanish a3s2_c816b9f0:

    # m "\"You're emperor now, Amicus.\""
    m "\"Ahora eres emperador, Amicus.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:787
translate spanish a3s2_f8664859:

    # "Amicus nods against me, not trusting his voice at the moment, apparently."
    "Amicus asiente contra mí; al parecer no se fía de su voz ahora."

# game/a3s2.rpy:788
translate spanish a3s2_34692129:

    # m "\"I'm so happy for you.\""
    m "\"Me alegro muchísimo por ti.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:789
translate spanish a3s2_46f09cb4:

    # "Now he shakes his head, smearing tears against my cheek."
    "Ahora niega con la cabeza, mojándome la mejilla con las lágrimas."

# game/a3s2.rpy:790
translate spanish a3s2_e15044c1:

    # "I hate seeing him like this."
    "Odio verlo así."

# game/a3s2.rpy:791
translate spanish a3s2_d6280302:

    # "I hate that this might be the last way that I'll see him."
    "Odio que quizá sea la última imagen que tenga de él."

# game/a3s2.rpy:792
translate spanish a3s2_f16ea218:

    # m "\"Please, don't cry. Let's just...be together right now.\""
    m "\"Por favor, no llores. Simplemente...estemos juntos ahora.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:793
translate spanish a3s2_ad43f0c1:

    # "I sit up straight and pull his head against {i}my{/i} chest for once, cradling his massive form against me, caressing his ears and neck."
    "Me incorporo y atraigo su cabeza contra {i}mi{/i} pecho por una vez, sosteniendo su enorme cuerpo y acariciándole las orejas y el cuello."

# game/a3s2.rpy:794
translate spanish a3s2_a1abb416:

    # m "\"I'm okay, I promise you. I went somewhere when I...died.\""
    m "\"Estoy bien, te lo prometo. Fui a algún lugar cuando...morí.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:795
translate spanish a3s2_656577fb:

    # "The word is so strange to say."
    "La palabra resulta tan extraña al pronunciarla."

# game/a3s2.rpy:796
translate spanish a3s2_f0f46375:

    # m "\"It was really nice, full of people. I wasn't alone. It was peaceful.\""
    m "\"Era muy agradable, lleno de gente. No estaba solo. Era tranquilo.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:797
translate spanish a3s2_2274206e:

    # "Amicus takes a deep shuddering breath, finally pulling back from my hug."
    "Amicus respira profunda y temblorosamente, apartándose por fin de mi abrazo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:799
translate spanish a3s2_705d5d4b:

    # a "\"That's wonderful, [mc]...But I'm sorry, because I'm not letting you go back there.\""
    a "\"Eso es maravilloso, [mc]...Pero lo siento, porque no voy a dejarte volver allí.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:800
translate spanish a3s2_930eb97a:

    # "Amicus suddenly looks resolute as he smirks through the tears."
    "Amicus parece decidido de pronto y sonríe de lado entre las lágrimas."

# game/a3s2.rpy:802
translate spanish a3s2_4ea30d8e:

    # a "\"You're coming back with me.\""
    a "\"Vas a volver conmigo.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:803
translate spanish a3s2_07e751bf:

    # "His voice breaks several times, and I can tell that he really means it."
    "Su voz se rompe varias veces, y sé que lo dice de verdad."

# game/a3s2.rpy:804
translate spanish a3s2_f8d53104:

    # "He really is certain that he's going to drag me back from the dimension of the dead."
    "Está verdaderamente seguro de que me sacará de la dimensión de los muertos."

# game/a3s2.rpy:805
translate spanish a3s2_930b20e1:

    # "I don't know what to say."
    "No sé qué decir."

# game/a3s2.rpy:806
translate spanish a3s2_37e770e5:

    # "I don't know much about the parents, or the afterlife, but Amicus must, so I trust him."
    "No sé mucho de los Padres ni de la vida después de la muerte, pero Amicus debe saberlo, así que confío en él."

# game/a3s2.rpy:807
translate spanish a3s2_9f5118df:

    # "I smile up at him."
    "Le sonrío desde abajo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:808
translate spanish a3s2_1f228d29:

    # m "\"Okay.\""
    m "\"Vale.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:811
translate spanish a3s2_e1d49337:

    # "He smiles back at me, then very suddenly kisses me."
    "Me devuelve la sonrisa y, muy de repente, me besa."

# game/a3s2.rpy:813
translate spanish a3s2_9f4a925c:

    # "It's rough and wet, and he kind of misses my lips, but I kiss back, holding him tightly."
    "Es un beso brusco y húmedo; casi no acierta en mis labios, pero le correspondo abrazándolo con fuerza."

# game/a3s2.rpy:815
translate spanish a3s2_3ad6ab1c:

    # "Once he finally draws back, I'm happy to see my wolf back to his usual, confident self...even if he has to keep sniffling with his runny nose."
    "Cuando finalmente se aparta, me alegra ver a mi lobo de nuevo como siempre, seguro de sí mismo...aunque siga sorbiendo por la nariz que le gotea."

# game/a3s2.rpy:816
translate spanish a3s2_9b006165:

    # "I look around at the swirling cosmos again."
    "Vuelvo a mirar el cosmos que gira."

# game/a3s2.rpy:818
translate spanish a3s2_57371acb:

    # m "\"Um, can you just...get us out?\""
    m "\"Eh, ¿puedes simplemente...sacarnos de aquí?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:819
translate spanish a3s2_a9cd40b5:

    # "Amicus frowns, looking around himself."
    "Amicus frunce el ceño y mira alrededor."

# game/a3s2.rpy:821
translate spanish a3s2_57ff040d:

    # a "\"Uh...this is actually my first time doing this, so...I'm not sure.\""
    a "\"Eh...en realidad es la primera vez que hago esto, así que...no estoy seguro.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:822
translate spanish a3s2_5910e41d:

    # "Amicus looks behind us, then up and down, then clears his throat."
    "Amicus mira detrás de nosotros, después arriba y abajo, y se aclara la garganta."

# game/a3s2.rpy:823
translate spanish a3s2_1b3cbd8f:

    # a "\"Er, Com? Com, are you there?\""
    a "\"Eh, ¿Com? Com, ¿estás ahí?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:824
translate spanish a3s2_16b8cb94:

    # "Silence."
    "Silencio."

# game/a3s2.rpy:826
translate spanish a3s2_059657c0:

    # a "\"Hmmm.\""
    a "\"Hmm.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:827
translate spanish a3s2_e0fd3d96:

    # "I can tell that Amicus is already out of ideas."
    "Noto que a Amicus ya se le han acabado las ideas."

# game/a3s2.rpy:828
translate spanish a3s2_a55dda4a:

    # m "\"The parents are doing this, right?\""
    m "\"Los Padres están haciendo esto, ¿no?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:829
translate spanish a3s2_dd7cdfce:

    # a "\"I think so, though I've never spoken to them. You actually have more experience with that.\""
    a "\"Eso creo, aunque nunca he hablado con ellos. En realidad tú tienes más experiencia con eso.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:831
translate spanish a3s2_7e231633:

    # "Amicus grins at me, then looks back up."
    "Amicus me sonríe y vuelve a mirar arriba."

# game/a3s2.rpy:833
translate spanish a3s2_6a8d5b6c:

    # a "\"Maybe if we walk...back.\""
    a "\"Quizá si caminamos...de vuelta.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:834
translate spanish a3s2_aeea7382:

    # "I give Amicus a strange look and just as I'm about to point out the absurdity of walking back to Adastra through infinite space, a booming presence makes itself known."
    "Lo miro extrañado y, justo cuando voy a señalar lo absurdo de volver andando a Adastra a través del espacio infinito, una presencia atronadora se manifiesta."

# game/a3s2.rpy:835
translate spanish a3s2_44312f17:

    # mon "\"I suppose you are finished?\""
    mon "\"Supongo que habéis terminado.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:837
translate spanish a3s2_92cfccaf:

    # "Amicus and I both jump and the wolf leaps to his feet, keeping me held in his arms."
    "Amicus y yo nos sobresaltamos; el lobo salta de pie, manteniéndome en brazos."

# game/a3s2.rpy:839
translate spanish a3s2_e390dde0:

    # a "\"Who's there!?\""
    a "\"¿¡Quién está ahí!?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:840
translate spanish a3s2_687a2bda:

    # "Amicus shouts into the void, snarling."
    "Amicus grita hacia el vacío, gruñendo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:841
translate spanish a3s2_acc36f1f:

    # m "\"It's okay Amicus, it's just the monitor.\""
    m "\"No pasa nada, Amicus: solo es el Monitor.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:842
translate spanish a3s2_3aa6fb50:

    # "I say it like he's just an old friend of mine."
    "Lo digo como si fuera un viejo amigo mío."

# game/a3s2.rpy:843
translate spanish a3s2_9f2dba3e:

    # "Amicus doesn't lower his guard however, and continues to growl into space."
    "Pero Amicus no baja la guardia y sigue gruñendo al espacio."

# game/a3s2.rpy:844
translate spanish a3s2_00b2da17:

    # "The monitor expresses his amusement in that silent way of his, but I can understand why Amicus isn't letting his guard down."
    "El Monitor expresa su diversión de aquella forma silenciosa, pero comprendo por qué Amicus no baja la guardia."

# game/a3s2.rpy:845
translate spanish a3s2_c5b03f57:

    # "It's evident in the way he's holding me, clutching me tightly to his chest."
    "Es evidente en cómo me sostiene, apretándome contra su pecho."

# game/a3s2.rpy:846
translate spanish a3s2_6aaad6a4:

    # "He afraid I'm going to be taken back from him."
    "Tiene miedo de que vuelvan a quitarme de su lado."

# game/a3s2.rpy:847
translate spanish a3s2_df3d0cdf:

    # "I am too."
    "Yo también."

# game/a3s2.rpy:848
translate spanish a3s2_9a2a5f9c:

    # mon "\"If you are, I'll open the channel of communication now.\""
    mon "\"Si es así, abriré ahora el canal de comunicación.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:849
translate spanish a3s2_d72f068f:

    # "Amicus raises an eyebrow."
    "Amicus alza una ceja."

# game/a3s2.rpy:850
translate spanish a3s2_c4f75a83:

    # a "\"What the hell are you talking about?\""
    a "\"¿De qué demonios hablas?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:851
translate spanish a3s2_cf0605ea:

    # mon "\"You wish to speak with the parents, correct? They wish to speak directly with you...at least as directly as is possible.\""
    mon "\"Queréis hablar con los Padres, ¿correcto? Ellos quieren hablar directamente con vosotros...al menos tan directamente como sea posible.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:852
translate spanish a3s2_32433a1c:

    # "There's a pause, and I see the gears turning in Amicus's head as his ears flick."
    "Hay una pausa; veo trabajar la mente de Amicus mientras se le mueven las orejas."

# game/a3s2.rpy:854
translate spanish a3s2_4eb44ffd:

    # a "\"...Yes.\""
    a "\"...Sí.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:855
translate spanish a3s2_5cd31eb8:

    # mon "\"Then it is done.\""
    mon "\"Entonces está hecho.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:856
translate spanish a3s2_1c65ca70:

    # "The monitor's presence vanishes and suddenly, there's another one."
    "La presencia del Monitor desaparece y, de pronto, hay otra."

# game/a3s2.rpy:857
translate spanish a3s2_5f1ab566:

    # "Not one, but many, similar to what I had felt earlier."
    "No una, sino muchas, parecidas a lo que sentí antes."

# game/a3s2.rpy:858
translate spanish a3s2_30fb2fb6:

    # "This is still different."
    "Pero sigue siendo diferente."

# game/a3s2.rpy:859
translate spanish a3s2_3aca30b5:

    # "Instead of melding together, these entities are distinct and separate from each other."
    "En lugar de fundirse, estas entidades son distintas y están separadas."

# game/a3s2.rpy:860
translate spanish a3s2_1dc5a203:

    # "But they're so similar that they could be copies of a single person."
    "Pero se parecen tanto que podrían ser copias de una sola persona."

# game/a3s2.rpy:861
translate spanish a3s2_6cb5f5a5:

    # "Their intentions feel disturbingly uniform, like they're all on the exact same path."
    "Sus intenciones se sienten inquietantemente uniformes, como si todas estuvieran exactamente en el mismo camino."

# game/a3s2.rpy:862
translate spanish a3s2_4b56d051:

    # "Unlike the monitor, who at least felt to be on a similar level as any other sapient, these entities feel...alien."
    "A diferencia del Monitor, que al menos parecía estar a un nivel parecido al de cualquier otro Sapiente, estas entidades se sienten...alienígenas."

# game/a3s2.rpy:863
translate spanish a3s2_37512a7d:

    # "Which is a strange thing to feel after everything I've been through, but these things are so different."
    "Es una sensación extraña después de todo lo que he vivido, pero estos seres son tan distintos."

# game/a3s2.rpy:864
translate spanish a3s2_83e9f6b8:

    # "...so..."
    "...tan..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:865
translate spanish a3s2_1b33addd:

    # "...different..."
    "...distintos..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:867
translate spanish a3s2_0c2a8fde:

    # a "\"Well? Show yourself.\""
    a "\"¿Y bien? Muéstrate.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:868
translate spanish a3s2_e7e0c949:

    # "Amicus barks at the emptiness, somehow remaining brave in the face of all these titanic presences."
    "Amicus ladra al vacío, manteniendo de algún modo el valor ante todas aquellas presencias gigantescas."

# game/a3s2.rpy:869
translate spanish a3s2_9bd74fc0:

    # m "\"You cannot see us.\""
    m "\"No puedes vernos.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:871
translate spanish a3s2_dc97480c:

    # "His mouth moves on its own, mind suddenly becoming empty, seeming to blend with the space around them."
    "Su boca se mueve sola; su mente se vacía de pronto y parece fundirse con el espacio que los rodea."

# game/a3s2.rpy:872
translate spanish a3s2_15e3739b:

    # "Amicus looks down at the human in confusion."
    "Amicus mira al humano confundido."

# game/a3s2.rpy:873
translate spanish a3s2_3c8805f7:

    # a "\"What?\""
    a "\"¿Qué?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:874
translate spanish a3s2_42f192bf:

    # "He stares back."
    "Él le devuelve la mirada."

# game/a3s2.rpy:875
translate spanish a3s2_9d350dcf:

    # m "\"We cannot speak directly to you.\""
    m "\"No podemos hablarte directamente.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:876
translate spanish a3s2_804cd142_2:

    # a "\"[mc]?\""
    a "\"¿[mc]?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:877
translate spanish a3s2_29c7a3ea:

    # m "\"But we have other methods...\""
    m "\"Pero tenemos otros métodos...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:878
translate spanish a3s2_1ed85b6b:

    # "Amicus's face morphs from confusion...to horror."
    "La cara de Amicus pasa de la confusión...al horror."

# game/a3s2.rpy:879
translate spanish a3s2_7cbebae0:

    # a "\"Gods...[mc]?\""
    a "\"Dioses...¿[mc]?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:880
translate spanish a3s2_ebc3432e:

    # "He gives the human a little shake."
    "Sacude un poco al humano."

# game/a3s2.rpy:881
translate spanish a3s2_80c0258d:

    # a "\"Hey...\""
    a "\"Eh...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:882
translate spanish a3s2_8eea217a:

    # m "\"He can hear you...he is simply occupied at the moment.\""
    m "\"Puede oírte...simplemente está ocupado en este momento.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:883
translate spanish a3s2_1ab0b2ee:

    # "Amicus bares his teeth, and he begins to shake."
    "Amicus enseña los dientes y empieza a temblar."

# game/a3s2.rpy:884
translate spanish a3s2_3fa72551:

    # "He's not sure if it's from anger, or fear."
    "No sabe si por ira o por miedo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:885
translate spanish a3s2_2507a891:

    # "Likely both."
    "Seguramente por ambas cosas."

# game/a3s2.rpy:886
translate spanish a3s2_e489c3af:

    # a "\"If...you don't stop—\""
    a "\"Si...no paráis—\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:887
translate spanish a3s2_42382a84:

    # m "\"There is no need to threaten. All is as it should be.\""
    m "\"No hace falta amenazar. Todo está como debe estar.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:888
translate spanish a3s2_54618166:

    # "Amicus is left to stand there, staring open-mouthed at his lover."
    "Amicus se queda allí de pie, mirando a su amante con la boca abierta."

# game/a3s2.rpy:889
translate spanish a3s2_e5b6010b:

    # "Something ominous and dark churns in his gut."
    "Algo ominoso y oscuro se agita en sus entrañas."

# game/a3s2.rpy:890
translate spanish a3s2_3afde2a4:

    # "This isn't how he'd envisioned...any of this at all."
    "No había imaginado así...nada de esto."

# game/a3s2.rpy:891
translate spanish a3s2_74ecb51f:

    # "These are the parents?"
    "¿Estos son los Padres?"

# game/a3s2.rpy:892
translate spanish a3s2_9f3d78ab:

    # a "\"What the hell are you?\""
    a "\"¿Qué demonios sois?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:893
translate spanish a3s2_f512fbf1:

    # m "\"We are your guide, your benevolent leader, your parent...\""
    m "\"Somos tu guía, tu dirigente benevolente, tu Padre...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:894
translate spanish a3s2_a1c05618:

    # "Amicus rubs a paw over the human's forehead gently, looking into those blank, staring eyes."
    "Amicus pasa suavemente una mano por la frente del humano, mirando aquellos ojos vacíos y fijos."

# game/a3s2.rpy:895
translate spanish a3s2_434a93a4:

    # a "\"Leave him be...please.\""
    a "\"Dejadlo en paz...por favor.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:896
translate spanish a3s2_eaba3dff:

    # m "\"He is not being harmed. He shall return to a normal state after the channeling is complete.\""
    m "\"No se le está haciendo daño. Volverá a su estado normal cuando termine la canalización.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:897
translate spanish a3s2_dcedb0ee:

    # a "\"But how?\""
    a "\"Pero ¿cómo?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:898
translate spanish a3s2_77d9dd1d:

    # m "\"Simply put, we are manipulating his behavior through the use of the Lingua.\""
    m "\"Dicho sencillamente: manipulamos su comportamiento mediante la Lingua.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:899
translate spanish a3s2_e22649b5:

    # "Amicus shakes his head, clearly not wanting this at all, but the complete powerlessness he feels right now...it's overwhelming."
    "Amicus niega con la cabeza, claramente rechazando todo esto, pero la impotencia absoluta que siente ahora...es abrumadora."

# game/a3s2.rpy:900
translate spanish a3s2_ba6660b9:

    # "The speech he'd been planning for this moment, his intention to tear apart the careless arrogance of the parents, it just dissipates."
    "El discurso que había planeado para este momento, su intención de destrozar la arrogancia descuidada de los Padres, simplemente se desvanece."

# game/a3s2.rpy:901
translate spanish a3s2_005738b1:

    # "Seeing [mc] just taken by them like this...it's enough to completely cow any courage he'd once had."
    "Ver cómo se apoderan de [mc]...basta para quebrar por completo cualquier valor que tuviera antes."

# game/a3s2.rpy:902
translate spanish a3s2_cebf9d82:

    # "And as he stares at the cold eyes of the human, he begins to wonder if this is a nightmare."
    "Mientras mira los ojos fríos del humano, empieza a preguntarse si es una pesadilla."

# game/a3s2.rpy:903
translate spanish a3s2_27fdab35:

    # "For a brief moment, Amicus wonders if any of this is real, what reality even is right now..."
    "Por un breve instante Amicus se pregunta si algo de esto es real, qué es siquiera la realidad ahora..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:904
translate spanish a3s2_1cc10926:

    # m "\"That is not for you to wonder, Amicus. All that matters is that you are the One True Emperor.\""
    m "\"No te corresponde preguntarte eso, Amicus. Lo único importante es que eres el Único Emperador Verdadero.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:905
translate spanish a3s2_b8d54c73:

    # a "\"What do you want?\""
    a "\"¿Qué quieres?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:906
translate spanish a3s2_8addc629:

    # "Amicus stares down at his human, feeling repulsed by what's happening."
    "Amicus mira a su humano, sintiendo repulsión por lo que pasa."

# game/a3s2.rpy:907
translate spanish a3s2_c1f27ea3:

    # m "\"For the work of Drusus to continue...for Adastra to achieve its full potential at last. For the {i}Galaxias{/i} to ascend.\""
    m "\"Para que continúe el trabajo de Drusus...para que Adastra alcance por fin todo su potencial. Para que el {i}Galaxias{/i} ascienda.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:908
translate spanish a3s2_5c0ab6a5:

    # "Amicus shakes his head, trying to focus, trying not to focus on the robotic tone of [mc]'s voice, on the strange way his jaw moves, forced to speak in the wolven tongue."
    "Amicus niega con la cabeza, intentando concentrarse, intentando no fijarse en el tono robótico de la voz de [mc] ni en el extraño movimiento de su mandíbula, obligada a hablar la lengua de los lobos."

# game/a3s2.rpy:909
translate spanish a3s2_3d382e9e:

    # a "\"I—I intend to do so...but please, let the human go, and—and heal him...please. He didn't ask for any of this.\""
    a "\"Y-yo tengo intención de hacerlo...pero, por favor, soltad al humano y-y curadlo...por favor. Él no pidió nada de esto.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:910
translate spanish a3s2_e9ced3fe:

    # m "\"The human is also involved, Amicus.\""
    m "\"El humano también está implicado, Amicus.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:911
translate spanish a3s2_c0ae4030:

    # a "\"But {i}I{/i} involved him.\""
    a "\"Pero {i}yo{/i} lo impliqué.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:912
translate spanish a3s2_4d342f8c:

    # m "\"It was meant to be.\""
    m "\"Estaba destinado a ser así.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:913
translate spanish a3s2_81a7d37b:

    # a "\"What—\""
    a "\"Qué—\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:914
translate spanish a3s2_a58d7bd4:

    # "Amicus isn't sure if it's his own mind, or the mind of another that brings back the memory of when he'd opened the archives, how Earth had been near the top of the list of profiled planets."
    "Amicus no sabe si su mente o la de otro trae el recuerdo de cuando abrió los archivos y la Tierra figuraba cerca de la parte superior de la lista de planetas catalogados."

# game/a3s2.rpy:915
translate spanish a3s2_d317d9fc:

    # "How it made no sense that an uncontacted world would be on that list at all."
    "No tenía sentido que un mundo sin contacto figurara en aquella lista."

# game/a3s2.rpy:916
translate spanish a3s2_c202b149:

    # "But now it does make sense...but at the same time even less sense."
    "Pero ahora sí tiene sentido...y a la vez todavía menos."

# game/a3s2.rpy:917
translate spanish a3s2_81971203:

    # "Amicus shakes his head, still reeling at the situation he's in, feeling that he's teetering on the edge of madness."
    "Amicus niega con la cabeza, aún tambaleándose por la situación, sintiendo que está al borde de la locura."

# game/a3s2.rpy:918
translate spanish a3s2_4a3dbb85:

    # m "\"Steady. There are many things you do not understand, things that you will never understand, and that is fine. Not all things are meant to be understood by all sapients.\""
    m "\"Mantente firme. Hay muchas cosas que no entiendes y que nunca entenderás, y eso está bien. No todo está destinado a ser comprendido por todos los Sapientes.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:919
translate spanish a3s2_377d33a8:

    # m "\"But you at least understand that the humans are not uncontacted, are they?\""
    m "\"Pero al menos entiendes que los humanos no carecen de contacto, ¿verdad?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:920
translate spanish a3s2_9f7ab979:

    # "Amicus says nothing, knowing that his mind is being read."
    "Amicus no dice nada, sabiendo que están leyendo su mente."

# game/a3s2.rpy:921
translate spanish a3s2_30bd3fb1:

    # m "\"Somehow wolven culture is there, so is Khemian culture, Hindo culture...all sibling cultures.\""
    m "\"De alguna manera está allí la cultura de los lobos, y la de Khemia, la de Hindo...todas las culturas Hermanas.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:922
translate spanish a3s2_4347ed74:

    # "The parents go silent and Amicus is left to stare at the puppet his lover has been turned into."
    "Los Padres callan y Amicus se queda mirando la marioneta en la que han convertido a su amante."

# game/a3s2.rpy:923
translate spanish a3s2_51f4938b:

    # "Amicus grits his teeth."
    "Amicus aprieta los dientes."

# game/a3s2.rpy:924
translate spanish a3s2_46fd2bda:

    # a "\"Why?\""
    a "\"¿Por qué?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:925
translate spanish a3s2_12003b34:

    # m "\"Because, they were an experimental microcosm...now a successful one, and it is time for them to be integrated into the {i}Galaxias{/i}.\""
    m "\"Porque eran un microcosmos experimental...ahora uno exitoso, y ha llegado el momento de integrarlos en el {i}Galaxias{/i}.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:926
translate spanish a3s2_6fcb5e4b:

    # "Another moment of silence."
    "Otro momento de silencio."

# game/a3s2.rpy:927
translate spanish a3s2_2d32daa2:

    # a "\"And...you want me to help do this?\""
    a "\"Y...¿queréis que ayude a hacerlo?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:928
translate spanish a3s2_19ec7c5c:

    # m "\"No, your mission is to help unite the siblings. The first step is Khemia.\""
    m "\"No, tu misión es ayudar a unir a los Hermanos. El primer paso es Khemia.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:929
translate spanish a3s2_2fac330d:

    # a "\"That was already my intention.\""
    a "\"Ya era mi intención.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:930
translate spanish a3s2_485e8f15:

    # m "\"That is questionable. The situation is perilous, Khemia is furious after what has happened. You need more guidance, thus why you are here.\""
    m "\"Eso es discutible. La situación es peligrosa; Khemia está furiosa por lo ocurrido. Necesitas más orientación, por eso estás aquí.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:931
translate spanish a3s2_72052591:

    # "Amicus snarls."
    "Amicus gruñe."

# game/a3s2.rpy:932
translate spanish a3s2_4d482758:

    # a "\"I'm here for HIM.\""
    a "\"Estoy aquí por ÉL.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:933
translate spanish a3s2_88395268:

    # "Amicus nods at [mc], at the sapient creature being used as a mouthpiece."
    "Amicus señala con la cabeza a [mc], a la criatura sapiente que usan como portavoz."

# game/a3s2.rpy:934
translate spanish a3s2_88fda3e6:

    # m "\"You are here for the {i}Galaxias{/i}, and as the emperor, you now have the onus to know all this information, as your father knew, as his father knew, and so on.\""
    m "\"Estás aquí por el {i}Galaxias{/i}; como emperador, ahora tienes la obligación de conocer toda esta información, como la conocía tu padre, y el suyo, y así sucesivamente.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:935
translate spanish a3s2_bb8eac4d:

    # "Amicus grits his teeth again, trying to comprehend what's being told to him despite being completely disturbed by what's happening to [mc]."
    "Amicus vuelve a apretar los dientes, intentando comprender lo que le dicen pese a estar completamente perturbado por lo que le ocurre a [mc]."

# game/a3s2.rpy:936
translate spanish a3s2_4b3c3a52:

    # a "\"If you wanted galactic integration, then why have we been competing with each other?\""
    a "\"Si queríais la integración galáctica, ¿por qué hemos estado compitiendo?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:937
translate spanish a3s2_704c2444:

    # m "\"This was assumed by the siblings themselves; competition was never the goal.\""
    m "\"Los propios Hermanos lo supusieron; la competencia nunca fue el objetivo.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:938
translate spanish a3s2_51918e83:

    # a "\"Then why not tell us that? You're supposed to be our guide.\""
    a "\"Entonces, ¿por qué no nos lo dijisteis? Se supone que sois nuestra guía.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:939
translate spanish a3s2_20e8d986:

    # m "\"The process is slow, and careful; interference is a last resort.\""
    m "\"El proceso es lento y cuidadoso; intervenir es el último recurso.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:940
translate spanish a3s2_ca93e98c:

    # m "\"This very communication is a last resort as the siblings and children stray further and further from the path every day, and not just the wolves.\""
    m "\"Esta misma comunicación es un último recurso, porque los Hermanos y los Hijos se apartan cada día más del camino, y no solo los lobos.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:941
translate spanish a3s2_898b900a:

    # m "\"It has taken 20,000 years to reach this point, and that time cannot be wasted.\""
    m "\"Ha llevado veinte mil años llegar hasta aquí, y ese tiempo no puede desperdiciarse.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:942
translate spanish a3s2_b94c7dec:

    # a "\"Then why are you telling only me this and not all sapients in the {i}Galaxias{/i}?\""
    a "\"Entonces, ¿por qué me lo decís solo a mí y no a todos los Sapientes del {i}Galaxias{/i}?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:943
translate spanish a3s2_de71baae:

    # "Amicus glares at the face of the human again, stroking the face gently, hating the blank stare he's receiving."
    "Amicus vuelve a mirar con furia la cara del humano, acariciándola suavemente y odiando la mirada vacía que recibe."

# game/a3s2.rpy:944
translate spanish a3s2_2ee47604:

    # m "\"As was stated, minimal interference will result in the best outcome. Only select figures are being informed at this stage. A {i}Galaxias{/i} developed independent of interference will better serve the greater cause as a whole.\""
    m "\"Como se ha dicho, una intervención mínima producirá el mejor resultado. En esta etapa solo se informa a figuras elegidas. Un {i}Galaxias{/i} desarrollado sin intervención servirá mejor a la causa mayor en su conjunto.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:945
translate spanish a3s2_b271b077:

    # a "\"The greater cause?\""
    a "\"¿La causa mayor?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:946
translate spanish a3s2_fb1509ae:

    # "The stars and planets shift around them, zooming forward, and for a moment Amicus feels as though he might be sick."
    "Las estrellas y los planetas cambian alrededor, avanzando velozmente; por un momento Amicus siente que podría vomitar."

# game/a3s2.rpy:947
translate spanish a3s2_7d2732c5:

    # "Something dark looms on the edge of the universe, growing slowly, leeching the parts that it touches."
    "Algo oscuro acecha en el borde del universo, creciendo lentamente y absorbiendo las partes que toca."

# game/a3s2.rpy:948
translate spanish a3s2_e6c3e29c:

    # m "\"The Other approaches, and it must be confronted.\""
    m "\"El Otro se acerca y debemos enfrentarnos a él.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:949
translate spanish a3s2_c54c7e7c:

    # "At this point, Amicus feels unease pierce through his fog of confusion and anger."
    "En ese momento Amicus siente que la inquietud atraviesa la niebla de confusión e ira."

# game/a3s2.rpy:950
translate spanish a3s2_c73d7751:

    # a "\"What Other...are we preparing for war against something?\""
    a "\"¿Qué Otro...? ¿Nos estamos preparando para una guerra contra algo?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:951
translate spanish a3s2_e2605dda:

    # m "\"We must prepare for an event many millennia from now. This is one step of many.\""
    m "\"Debemos prepararnos para un acontecimiento dentro de muchos milenios. Este es un paso entre muchos.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:952
translate spanish a3s2_d883c03a:

    # "Amicus lets out a low growl of frustration, the vagueness of this entire situation making his head ache."
    "Amicus emite un gruñido bajo de frustración; la vaguedad de toda la situación le hace doler la cabeza."

# game/a3s2.rpy:953
translate spanish a3s2_c530e32b:

    # a "\"But what does this have to do with [mc]?\""
    a "\"Pero ¿qué tiene que ver con [mc]?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:954
translate spanish a3s2_f6d28bd2:

    # "Amicus shifts his hold on the human, just wanting him to come back to consciousness."
    "Amicus cambia cómo sostiene al humano, deseando simplemente que recupere la conciencia."

# game/a3s2.rpy:955
translate spanish a3s2_2babf566:

    # m "\"He must play a role...and you must make a decision, Amicus...\""
    m "\"Debe cumplir un papel...y tú debes tomar una decisión, Amicus...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:957
translate spanish a3s2_32ca118a:

    # "Everything seems to come together all at once for Amicus."
    "Todo parece encajar a la vez para Amicus."

# game/a3s2.rpy:960
translate spanish a3s2_32ca118a_1:

    # "Everything seems to come together all at once for Amicus."
    "Todo parece encajar a la vez para Amicus."

